_ACCOUNT_NO_ACCESS_DESC":"Your friend lists, channel memberships, profile information and all personal data are permanently deleted. This action cannot be undone.","DELETE_ACCOUNT_NO_ACCESS_TITLE":"You can never access your account again","DELETE_ACCOUNT_PASSWORD_PROMPT":"Enter your password to delete your account. This action &lt;strong&gt;cannot be undone.&lt;/strong&gt;","DELETE_ACCOUNT_PERMANENTLY":"Permanently Delete My Account","DELETE_ACCOUNT_PRIVACY_NOTICE":"To learn more about how your data is processed, you can review our &lt;a href=\"https://voxnup.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary fw-semibold\"&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.","DELETE_ACCOUNT_READ_INFO":"Read the information below carefully before continuing.","DELETE_CHANNEL_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to delete this channel? This action cannot be undone.","DELETE_ROOM_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to delete this room? All messages in it will also be deleted and this action cannot be undone.","DELETE_CATEGORY_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to delete this category? Its rooms will be moved to the uncategorized section.","DELETE_ERROR":"An error occurred during deletion.","DELETE_FAILED":"Delete operation failed.","DELETE_ITEM_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to delete \"%s\"?","DELETE_MESSAGE":"Delete Message","DELETE_MESSAGE_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to delete this message?","DELETE_SOUND":"Delete Sound","DELETE_SOUND_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to delete the sound \"%s\"?","DELETING":"Deleting...","DESC_ACTIVITY_MANAGER":"Manage definitions for activity detection","DESC_ADMIN_CHANNELS":"Voxnup channel management and ban panel","DESC_DEVROOM":"Voxnup platform statistics and system status","DESC_SUPPORT":"Voxnup support center. Frequently asked questions, technical help and contact information.","DESKTOP_APP_ONLY_FEATURE":"This feature is only available in the desktop app","DESKTOP_NOTIFICATIONS":"Desktop Notifications","DESKTOP_NOTIFICATIONS_DESC":"Show desktop notificatio