ve across the channel. Anything you leave alone comes from the category and the channel role.","RS_CAT_PERMS_LEAD":"These apply to every room in the category. A room's own setting takes precedence over the category's.","RS_NO_PERM_PERMS":"You need the Manage Permissions permission to edit permissions.","RS_MEMBERS":"Members","RS_ADD_MEMBER":"Add member","RS_NO_MEMBER_OVERRIDES":"No member-specific permissions.","RS_RESET_ALL":"Reset all to default","RS_REMOVE_MEMBER":"Remove member","RS_SEARCH_MEMBER":"Search members","RS_CATEGORY_SETTINGS":"Category Settings","RS_PERMS_LOAD_ERROR":"Couldn't load permissions.","RS_OVERRIDE_COUNT":"Permissions changed here","RS_MEMBER_LOCKED":"This member's role is equal to or higher than yours; you can't edit their permissions.","RS_NO_MEMBER_MATCH":"No matching members.","RS_CATEGORY_NAME_EMPTY":"Category name can't be empty.","RS_CATEGORY_SAVED":"Category saved.","ROOM_TOPIC":"Room Topic","ROOM_TOPIC_ENTER":"Enter the room's topic or description","ROOM_TOPIC_HINT":"Shows members what this room is used for.","SAVE_AND_LOGIN":"Save &amp; Log in","SAY_HELLO_MESSAGE":"Hey! Hi there :man_raising_hand:","SCREEN_SHARE_ENDED":"Screen Share Ended","SCREEN_SHARE_STARTED":"Screen Share Started","SCREEN_SHARE_VIEWER_JOINED":"Viewer Joined Screen Share","SCREEN_SHARE_VIEWER_LEFT":"Viewer Left Screen Share","SEARCH_MEMBER":"Search members...","SEARCH_PLACEHOLDER":"Search...","SEARCH_SOUNDS":"Search sounds...","SECONDS_SHORT":"s","SELECTED_FIELD":"Selected Field","SELECTED_REASON":"Selected Reason","SELECTED_USER":"Selected User","SELECT_CHANNEL_PHOTO":"Select Channel Photo","SELECT_COVER_PHOTO":"Select Cover Photo","SELECT_EMOJI":"Select emoji","SELECT_LANGUAGE":"Select a Language","SELECT_OR_DRAG_IMAGE":"Select or drag an image","SELECT_ROLE_TO_ADD":"Select the Role to Add","SEND_CHANNEL_INVITE_TO_FRIEND":"Send a Channel Invite Link to a Friend","SEND_MESSAGE":"Send Message","SEND_MESSAGES_IN_THREADS_PERM":"Send Messages in Threads","SEND_MESS