ND_PANEL_DESC":"Manage the channel's sound effects · Max. 10 sounds","SOUND_PLAY_ERROR":"Sound could not be played.","SOUND_UPLOAD_ERROR":"An error occurred while uploading the sound.","SPEAK_PERM":"Speak","SPEAK_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to speak in voice rooms. When off, members can join and listen but their audio isn't sent to others.","STAR_MESSAGE":"Star Message","STATIC_ROLE_CANNOT_BE_REMOVED":"This is a default role assigned to everyone and cannot be removed.","STATUS":"Status","STATUS_MESSAGE":"Status Message","STICKER":"Sticker","STICKERS_LABEL":"Stickers","STICKERS_LOAD_ERROR":"Stickers could not be loaded.","STICKERS_ONLY_IN_CHANNELS":"Stickers can only be used in channels.","STICKER_NAME":"Sticker Name","STICKER_NAME_HELP":"Display name for the sticker","STICKER_NAME_PLACEHOLDER":"e.g. Happy Cat","STOP":"Stop","STREAMER_MODE_DESC":"Keeps your personal notifications off screen while you stream or share your screen.","SUMMARY":"Summary","TEMPLATE_COMMUNITY":"Community Channel","TEMPLATE_COMMUNITY_DESC":"A large community with introduction, announcement and event rooms.","TEMPLATE_EMPTY":"Blank Template","TEMPLATE_EMPTY_DESC":"Start with 1 chat room and 1 voice chat room.","TEMPLATE_GAME":"Gaming Channel","TEMPLATE_GAME_DESC":"A full gaming community with announcement, chat and team rooms.","TENOR_API_INVALID_RESPONSE":"Invalid response received from the GIF service.","TEST_SHORTCUT_TRIGGERED":"Test shortcut triggered!","TEXT":"Text","TEXT_CHANNEL_PERMISSIONS":"Text Channel Permissions","THEME":"Theme","THIS_DEVICE":"This Device","TIMEOUT_MEMBERS_PERM":"Timeout Members","TIMEOUT_USER":"Time Out","REMOVE_TIMEOUT":"Remove Timeout","NO_PERM_TIMEOUT_USER":"You don't have permission to time out this user.","USER_TIMED_OUT":"The user has been timed out.","USER_TIMEOUT_REMOVED":"The user's timeout has been removed.","TIMEOUT_ACTIVE_NOTICE":"You are temporarily muted in this channel. Time left: %s.","TIMEOUT_MEMBERS_PERM_DESC":"Allows timing out a user to prevent them from sending messages or joining voice chat.","TITLE_ACTIVITY_MANAGER":"Activity Manager | Voxnup","TITLE_ADMIN_CHANNELS":"Admin — Channel Management | Voxnup","TITLE_DEFAULT":"Voxnup - Chat with your friends, play games","TITLE_DEVROOM":"DevRoom - Developer Panel | Voxnup","TITLE_PRIVACY":"Voxnup - Terms of Use and Privacy Policy","TITLE_RESET_PASSWORD":"Voxnup - Reset Password","RESET_LINK_SENT":"If this email is registered, a password reset link has been sent. Please check your inbox.","TITLE_SUPPORT":"Voxnup - Support Center","TITLE_TRANSACTION_EMAIL_CHANGE":"Voxnup - Your email change request is complete","TITLE_TRANSACTION_INVALID":"Voxnup - Invalid Transaction","TITLE_TRANSACTION_PASSWORD_CHANGE":"Voxnup - Password Change","TITLE_TRANSACTION_REGISTRATION":"Voxnup - Your registration is complete","TODAY_AT":"Today at %s","TOGGLE_DEAFEN":"Toggle Deafen","TOGGLE_MICROPHONE":"Mute/Unmute Microphone","TOGGLE_NOISE_REDUCTION":"Toggle Voice Gate (when off, your mic stays open)","TOGGLE_SPEAKER":"Mute/Unmute Speaker","TRANSACTION_REGISTRATION_TEXT_1":"Click the \"Log in\" button below to sign in to your account and","TRANSACTION_REGISTRATION_TEXT_2":"Everything is ready — you can start having fun right away.","TRIMMED_SIZE_EXCEEDS":"The trimmed sound still exceeds %sMB.","TRIM_DRAG_HINT":"Drag the handles to select up to 5 seconds.","TRIM_MAX_DURATION":"The selected range can be at most %s seconds.","TRIM_SELECTED_LABEL":"%ss selected","TRIM_SOUND":"Trim Sound","UNBAN_USER_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to unban %s?\n\nBan Reason: %s","UNBAN_USER_TITLE":"Unban User","UNBLOCK":"Unblock","BLOCKED_USERS":"Blocked users","BLOCKED_USERS_DESC":"People you have blocked. If you unblock someone, they can message and call you again; the friendship does not come back on its own.","BLOCKED_USERS_EMPTY":"You haven't blocked anyone.","UNBLOCK_LINK":"unblock them.","UNDEAFEN":"Undeafen","UNDERSTOOD_CONTINUE":"I Understand, Continue","UNLIMITED":"Unlimited","UNMUTE_MICROPHONE":"Unmute Microphone","UNSAVED_CHANGES_EXIT_WARNING":"Warning! Press \"Exit\" Again to Leave Without Saving Your Changes","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_CONTINUE":"OK, Continue.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DETECTED_PREFIX":"Our system detected that you signed in using the","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DETECTED_SUFFIX":"browser.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DONE_CLOSE":"I Have Completed the Steps, Close","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_GUIDE_DESC":"For a smooth experience you need to apply the following two steps in your Opera settings.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_GUIDE_TITLE":"Browser Configuration Guide","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_P1":"Your browser's built-in &lt;span class=\"text-danger fw-bold\"&gt;Ad Blocker&lt;/span&gt; and strict &lt;span class=\"text-danger fw-bold\"&gt;WebRTC&lt;/span&gt; security policies restrict Voxnup's real-time communication infrastructure.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_P2":"Due to these restrictions, core features such as &lt;strong&gt;instant messaging, voice/video communication and live notifications&lt;/strong&gt; may be interrupted or may not run at full performance.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_SHOW_FIX":"Show Me How to Fix It","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_STEP1_DESC":"In your browser settings, follow &lt;strong&gt;Privacy &amp; Security &gt; Privacy Protection &gt; Manage exceptions&lt;/strong&gt; and add &lt;code&gt;[*.]voxnup.com&lt;/code&gt; to the list to allow the platform.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_STEP1_TITLE":"1. Ad Blocker Exception","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_STEP2_DESC":"In your browser settings, go to &lt;strong&gt;System &gt; WebRTC&lt;/strong&gt; and select &lt;strong&gt;\"Use All Available Network Interfaces (Recommended)\"&lt;/strong&gt; from the dropdown menu.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_STEP2_TITLE":"2. WebRTC Permissions","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_TITLE":"Not Fully Supported Browser","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_WARNING_TEXT":"Even if you complete these configurations, the platform may not work properly due to Opera's core restrictions. For an uninterrupted experience you may prefer a different browser.","UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_WARNING_TITLE":"Important Reminder","UPLOAD":"Upload","UPLOAD_ERROR":"An error occurred during upload.","UPLOAD_NEW_EMOJI":"Upload New Emoji","UPLOAD_NEW_SOUND":"Upload New Sound","UPLOAD_NEW_STICKER":"Upload New Sticker","USER":"User","USERNAME_EXAMPLE":"user.name","USER_ADDED_TO_ROLE":"User successfully added to the role.","USER_ADD_TO_ROLE_ERROR":"An error occurred while adding the user to the role.","USER_ALREADY_HAS_ROLE":"User is already a member of this role.","USER_BANNED_FROM_CHANNEL":"User banned from the channel.","USER_BAN_ERROR":"An error occurred while banning the user.","USER_ID":"User ID","USER_IMAGE":"User Image","USER_JOINED_ROOM":"User Joined Room","USER_KICKED_FROM_CHANNEL":"User successfully kicked from the channel.","USER_KICK_ERROR":"An error occurred while kicking the user from the channel.","USER_LEFT_ROOM":"User Left Room","USER_MOVED_TO_ROOM":"User Moved to Room","USER_NOT_BLOCKED":"User is not blocked.","USER_NOT_IN_CHANNEL":"User is not a member of this channel.","USER_ROLE_NOT_FOUND":"User role not found.","USER_ROLE_REMOVED":"User role successfully removed.","USER_ROLE_REMOVE_ERROR":"An error occurred while removing the user role.","USER_UNBANNED_FROM_CHANNEL":"User's channel ban has been removed.","USER_UNBAN_ERROR":"User could not be unbanned","USER_UNBAN_SUCCESS":"User has been unbanned","USE_APP_COMMANDS_PERM":"Use Application Commands","USE_APP_COMMANDS_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to use app commands, including slash and context menu commands.","USE_SOUND_PANEL_PERM":"Use Sound Panel","USE_SOUND_PANEL_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to play sounds from the soundboard in voice rooms.","VALID_INVITE_LINK":"Valid invite link","VIDEO_PERM":"Video","VIDEO_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to turn on their camera and share their screen in voice rooms.","VIEWING_PREVIOUS_MESSAGE":"Viewing Previous Message","VIEW_AUDIT_LOG_PERM":"View Audit Log","VIEW_AUDIT_LOG_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to see who changed what in the channel in the Audit Log.","VIEW_CHANNEL_INFO_PERM":"View Channel Information","VIEW_CHANNEL_INFO_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to view the channel information.","VIEW_ON_MICROSOFT_STORE":"View on Microsoft Store","VIEW_ROOMS_PERM":"View Rooms","VIEW_ROOMS_PERM_DESC":"Allows members to see the rooms in the channel (except private rooms).","VOICE":"Voice","VOICE_CALL_CONNECT_ERROR":"Could not connect to the voice call. Please try again.","VOICE_CHANNEL_SETTINGS":"Voice Channel Settings","VOICE_ROOM_PERMISSIONS":"Voice Room Permissions","VOICE_SETTINGS":"Voice Settings","VOXBOT_MANAGEMENT":"Voxbot Management","VOXBOT_SETTINGS":"Voxbot Settings","VOXNUP_RESET_PASSWORD":"Voxnup Password Reset","VOXNUP_SOUNDS":"Voxnup Sounds","WAITING_FOR_SOCKET":"Waiting for Socket","WELCOME_TO_VOXNUP":"Welcome to Voxnup","YES":"Yes","YOUR_DISPLAY_NAME":"Your Display Name","YOUR_EMAIL_ADDRESS":"Your Email Address","MIC_NOT_FOUND_STEP_CONNECT":"Make sure your microphone is properly connected to your computer.","MIC_NOT_FOUND_STEP_WIRELESS":"If you use a wireless headset or microphone, check that it is connected and turned on.","MIC_NOT_FOUND_STEP_SYSTEM":"Verify that the microphone is enabled in your operating system's sound settings.","MIC_NOT_FOUND_STEP_RETRY":"Then press the Try Again button below.","MIC_PERMISSION_RETRY":"Try Again","MIC_RETRYING":"Trying...","MIC_RECONNECTED":"Microphone connected! You can now speak.","MIC_STILL_NOT_FOUND":"The microphone still could not be detected. Check the steps and try again.","MIC_TEST_START":"Test Microphone","MIC_TEST_STOP":"Stop Test","MIC_TEST_HINT":"Start the test to see your microphone level and adjust the input range.","MIC_TEST_LISTENING":"Listening to your microphone. Speak to check your level.","MIC_TEST_PERMISSION_REQUIRED":"Microphone permission is required to list audio devices. You will be asked for permission when you start the test.","MIC_TEST_PERMISSION_DENIED":"Microphone permission was denied. Allow it in your browser settings and try again.","MIC_PERMISSION_REQUIRED_OPTION":"Microphone permission required","DEFAULT_DEVICE":"Default device","AUDIO_SETUP_INTRO_TITLE":"Let's set up your audio","AUDIO_SETUP_INTRO_DESC":"Before you join a voice chat, let's pick your microphone and speaker. It only takes a few seconds.","AUDIO_SETUP_NEXT":"Next","AUDIO_SETUP_LATER":"Later","AUDIO_SETUP_PERMISSION_FAILED":"Microphone and audio permissions were not granted","AUDIO_SETUP_PERMISSION_FAILED_DESC":"To list your audio devices, you need to grant microphone permission in your browser.","AUDIO_SETUP_RETRY":"Try Again","MIC_PERMISSION_STILL_STUCK":"Still not working?","MIC_PERMISSION_CONTACT_SUPPORT":"See the step-by-step troubleshooting guide","ALL_RIGHTS_RESERVED":"All rights reserved.","ARE_YOU_READY":"Are you ready?","AUTHOR":"Author","BLOG_TEAM_AUTHOR":"Voxnup Team","BACK_TO_TOP":"Top","BETA_BAR_TEXT":"Voxnup is currently in &lt;strong&gt;beta&lt;/strong&gt;. There may be bugs and missing features — your feedback means a lot to us!","CONTACT_US":"Contact Us","CTA_JOIN_TEXT":"Your communities and friends are waiting for you inside. Join them and start having fun.","DOWNLOAD_FOR_WINDOWS":"Download for Windows","FEATURE_ACTIVITIES_DESC":"Your friends see you while you play games &amp; listen to music. So they can invite you to play or join you.","FEATURE_ACTIVITIES_TITLE":"Activities","FEATURE_CHAT_DESC":"Add your friends and either message or voice chat with them.","FEATURE_CHAT_TITLE":"Chat With Your Friends","FEATURE_CREATE_COMMUNITY_DESC":"Looking for a community to hang out with your friends? Then what are you waiting for? Create your own community.","FEATURE_CREATE_COMMUNITY_TITLE":"Create a Community","FEATURE_JOIN_COMMUNITIES_DESC":"Search for any community in the community browser. Join a server in the category you like.","FEATURE_JOIN_COMMUNITIES_TITLE":"Join Communities","FOOTER_CONTACT_US":"Contact Us","FOOTER_PRIVACY":"Privacy","FOOTER_DEVELOPERS":"Developers","DISCOVER_TITLE":"Discover","DISCOVER_SUBTITLE":"Explore communities that fit you, join with one click","DISCOVER_ALL":"All","DISCOVER_JOIN":"Join","DISCOVER_JOINED":"Joined","DISCOVER_MEMBERS":"members","DISCOVER_EMPTY":"No communities in this category yet","DISCOVER_SEARCH":"Search communities","DISCOVER_LOGIN_TO_JOIN":"Sign in to join","DISCOVERY_CAT_GAMING":"Gaming","DISCOVERY_CAT_COMMUNITY":"Community","DISCOVERY_CAT_ART":"Art &amp; Design","DISCOVERY_CAT_MUSIC":"Music","DISCOVERY_CAT_EDUCATION":"Education","DISCOVERY_CAT_TECHNOLOGY":"Technology","DISCOVERY_CAT_ENTERTAINMENT":"Entertainment","DISCOVERY_CAT_OTHER":"Other","DISCOVER_CTA_TITLE":"Want your community to appear here?","DISCOVER_CTA_DESC":"Create your own community; if you already have one, check out the support page for the discovery listing rules.","DISCOVER_CTA_CREATE":"Create a Community","DISCOVER_CTA_SUPPORT":"Listing Rules","FOOTER_SOCIAL_MEDIA":"Social Media","FOOTER_TAGLINE":"Where gaming and friendship meet.","FOOTER_TERMS":"Terms","FOOTER_USEFUL_LINKS":"Useful Links","GAMES_YOU_PLAY_DESC":"The games you play or music you listen to in real time show up to your friends.","GAMES_YOU_PLAY_TITLE":"The Games You Play Show Up Here","HERO_BENEFIT_COMMUNICATION":"Seamless Communication","HERO_BENEFIT_FUN":"Unlimited Fun","HERO_BENEFIT_PLAY_TALK":"Play &amp; Talk","HERO_BENEFIT_SOCIAL":"Social Gaming","HERO_DESCRIPTION":"Voxnup is a platform where you can play games and chat with your friends. Chat privately or join a global community. Maybe you'll build a new community yourself. Voxnup is here for you.","HERO_SUBTITLE":"Voxnup isn't just a chat app; it's where gaming and friendship meet. Break down the barriers and open up to the world, or build your own private group. Here, you never play alone.","HERO_TITLE":"Your Community, Your World","HOURS_AGO":"%s Hours Ago","ITS_THAT_SIMPLE":"It's that simple","JOIN_COMMUNITY_CHANNELS_TITLE":"Join Community Channels","LANDING_ACTIVITY_DESC":"See what your friends are playing or listening to right now. With Voxnup's rich activity status, you can jump into games with a single click.","LANDING_ACTIVITY_TITLE":"Share Your Activity, Catch the Rhythm","LANDING_BETA_BANNER":"Voxnup is currently in &lt;strong&gt;beta&lt;/strong&gt;. There may be bugs and missing features — your feedback means the world to us!","LANDING_BUILD_COMMUNITY_TITLE":"Build Your Community Here","LANDING_COMMUNITY_ART_DESC":"Showcase your work, go live, and connect with fellow art lovers. Voxnup's flexible component system lets you share your creativity without limits.","LANDING_COMMUNITY_ART_TITLE":"Art &amp; Design","LANDING_COMMUNITY_DEVS_DESC":"The ideal space for sharing code, technical support, and brainstorming. Showcase your projects to your community, gather feedback, and keep your finger on the pulse of the tech world.","LANDING_COMMUNITY_DEVS_TITLE":"Developers &amp; Technology","LANDING_COMMUNITY_GAMERS_DESC":"Turn up the competition. Create private channels for your clan, host tournaments, and celebrate your victories with low-latency voice chat. Voxnup is the new home for gamers.","LANDING_COMMUNITY_GAMERS_TITLE":"Gamers &amp; Teams","LANDING_COMMUNITY_IMG_ALT":"Voxnup Community","LANDING_DOWNLOAD_WINDOWS":"Download for Windows","LANDING_DOWNLOAD_ANDROID":"Download for Android","LANDING_DOWNLOAD_IOS":"Download for iOS","LANDING_OTHER_PLATFORMS":"Other platforms:","LANDING_EARLY_ACCESS":"Early Access","LANDING_EXPLORE_DESC":"Become part of our community that grows every day. With its modern design and user-friendly interface, Voxnup offers the most fun way to spend time with friends. With voice channels, private messages, and game integrations, this is your new home in the digital world.","LANDING_EXPLORE_TITLE":"Explore the World of Voxnup","LANDING_FEATURE_BUILD_DESC":"Control is entirely in your hands. Build your own community from scratch, set your rules, and manage your members. With an advanced permission system and customizable components, creating the digital space of your dreams has never been easier.","LANDING_FEATURE_BUILD_TITLE":"Build Your Own World","LANDING_FEATURE_PLAY_DESC":"This isn't just a chat app — it's the heart of gaming. While playing your favorite games with friends, you can strategize in real time or join in-platform events. With its play-first design, Voxnup turns every win into a celebration.","LANDING_FEATURE_PLAY_TITLE":"Play, Share, Win","LANDING_FEATURE_SOCIAL_DESC":"Voxnup is designed not just for messaging your friends, but for building a real bond. Erase the distances with crystal-clear voice channels and fluid text chats. Whether you talk one-on-one or become part of a global community of thousands, communication here is always fast and free.","LANDING_FEATURE_SOCIAL_TITLE":"Seamless Socializing","LANDING_LATEST_NEWS":"Latest News from Voxnup","LANDING_SEND_FEEDBACK":"Send Feedback","LANDING_STAT_CHANNELS":"Active Channels","LANDING_STAT_USERS":"Registered Users","LANDING_TAB_COMMUNITY":"Free Community Management","LANDING_TAB_GAMING":"Gaming &amp; Entertainment Focused","LANDING_WHY_VOXNUP":"Why Voxnup?","LAUNCH_VOXNUP":"Launch Voxnup","MANAGE_COMMUNITIES_STEP1":"Choose your community's category","MANAGE_COMMUNITIES_STEP2":"Set your community's name &amp; image","MANAGE_COMMUNITIES_STEP3":"Send invites to your friends or tell them to find you in the community browser","MANAGE_COMMUNITIES_TITLE":"Manage your communities","MENU":"Menu","NEWS":"News","ONE_APP_ENDLESS_FUN":"One app - Endless fun","PLAY_GAMES_HAVE_FUN":"Play Games &amp; Have Fun","PRIVACY":"Privacy","SCROLL_TOP":"Top","SEE_MORE":"See More","SEO_ARTICLE_DESCRIPTION":"An article from the Voxnup blog — news, updates and tips about our chat app.","SEO_ARTICLE_KEYWORDS":"voxnup, blog, article, news, updates, chat app","SEO_BLOG_DESCRIPTION":"Official Voxnup announcements and release notes: new features, updates and changes.","SEO_BLOG_KEYWORDS":"voxnup, blog, news, updates, announcements, chat app, community","SEO_BLOG_TITLE":"Voxnup - Announcements and Release Notes","SEO_INDEXV2_DESCRIPTION":"Voxnup - Play Games, Chat With Your Friends","SEO_INDEXV2_KEYWORDS":"voxnup, meeting, play games, gaming, chat, voice chat, voice","SEO_INDEXV2_TITLE":"Voxnup - Play Games, Chat With Your Friends","SEO_INDEX_DESC":"Voxnup is where gaming and friendship meet. Build your own community with voice chat rooms, private channels, and seamless communication. Free to use — get started now.","SEO_INDEX_KEYWORDS":"voxnup, voice chat, gaming community, discord alternative, voice channel, play with friends, online gaming, gaming chat app, turkish voice chat","SEO_INDEX_OG_DESC":"Voxnup is where gaming and friendship meet. Build your own community with voice chat rooms, private channels, and seamless communication.","SEO_INDEX_TITLE":"Voxnup - Play, Chat, and Build Your Community with Friends","SOCIAL_MEDIA":"Social Media","START_HAVING_FUN_TITLE":"Start Having Fun","SUPPORT_BETA_EARLY_ACCESS":"EARLY ACCESS","SUPPORT_BETA_IN_DEVELOPMENT":"IN DEVELOPMENT","SUPPORT_BETA_WHAT_LI1":"Core features are complete and usable","SUPPORT_BETA_WHAT_LI2":"Some features may be missing or experimental","SUPPORT_BETA_WHAT_LI3":"You may encounter bugs and performance issues","SUPPORT_BETA_WHAT_P1":"&lt;strong&gt;Beta&lt;/strong&gt; is the name of the testing phase software goes through before its general release. During this stage the app is functional and usable; however, some features are still being developed and bugs are being fixed.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHAT_P2":"Beta users are the ones who truly discover the app first. With their feedback they directly contribute to shaping the product.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHAT_TITLE":"What is Beta?","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_ITEM1_DESC":"Every bug report and suggestion directly improves the product.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_ITEM1_TITLE":"Your feedback matters","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_ITEM2_DESC":"We release updates frequently during beta.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_ITEM2_TITLE":"Fast update cycle","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_ITEM3_DESC":"We shape Voxnup together.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_ITEM3_TITLE":"We grow together with the community","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_P1":"To make Voxnup perfect, we need &lt;strong&gt;the experiences of real users&lt;/strong&gt;. The feedback we gather during beta directly influences our development priorities.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_P2":"We welcomed you at an early stage because we want to build Voxnup together with you.","SUPPORT_BETA_WHY_TITLE":"Why Beta?","SUPPORT_CATEGORIES_SUBTITLE":"Choose a category based on your issue","SUPPORT_CATEGORIES_TITLE":"Help Categories","SUPPORT_CAT_ACCOUNT":"Account &amp; Security","SUPPORT_CAT_ACCOUNT_DESC":"Guides for changing your password, deleting your account, and account management.","SUPPORT_CAT_DOWNLOAD":"Download &amp; Updates","SUPPORT_CAT_DOWNLOAD_DESC":"App installation, updates, and release notes.","SUPPORT_CAT_GETTING_STARTED":"Getting Started","SUPPORT_CAT_GETTING_STARTED_DESC":"Creating an account, signing in, and first steps.","SUPPORT_CAT_NOTIFICATIONS_DESC":"Adjust, mute, or customize your notification preferences.","SUPPORT_CAT_REPORTING":"Reporting","SUPPORT_CAT_REPORTING_DESC":"User or content complaints and safety reports.","SUPPORT_CAT_SERVERS":"Servers &amp; Channels","SUPPORT_CAT_SERVERS_DESC":"Creating channels, managing members, and role settings.","SUPPORT_CAT_TECHNICAL":"Technical Issues","SUPPORT_CAT_TECHNICAL_DESC":"Connection errors, app crashes, and error codes.","SUPPORT_CAT_VOICE":"Voice &amp; Microphone","SUPPORT_CAT_VOICE_DESC":"Audio settings, microphone issues, and device configuration.","SUPPORT_CONTACT_COMMUNITY_BUTTON":"Join the Community","SUPPORT_CONTACT_COMMUNITY_DESC":"Join our Voxnup community and get tips and help from other users.","SUPPORT_CONTACT_COMMUNITY_TITLE":"Community","SUPPORT_CONTACT_EMAIL_DESC":"Email us for detailed questions; we usually respond within 24 hours.","SUPPORT_CONTACT_EMAIL_TITLE":"Email Support","SUPPORT_CONTACT_SOCIAL_DESC":"Follow our Instagram account for announcements, updates, and community contact.","SUPPORT_CONTACT_SOCIAL_TITLE":"Social Media","SUPPORT_CONTACT_SUBTITLE":"Our team is happy to help you","SUPPORT_CONTACT_TITLE":"Still need help?","SUPPORT_FAQ_A1":"To sign up for Voxnup, visit &lt;a href=\"/rooms\" class=\"text-primary fw-medium\"&gt;voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt; and click the \"Sign Up\" button. You can create an account in seconds with your email and a password.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A2_LI1":"Make sure the correct input device is selected under Settings → Audio.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A2_LI2":"Check whether your browser's microphone permission is enabled.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A2_LI3":"If you're using the desktop app, try restarting it.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A2_LI4":"If the problem persists, contact &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\" class=\"text-primary fw-medium\"&gt;our support team&lt;/a&gt;.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A3":"Click the \"Forgot Password\" link on the login screen. A password reset link will be sent to your registered email. If the email doesn't arrive within a few minutes, check your spam/junk folder.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A4":"You can create a new channel by clicking the \"+\" icon in the left panel. Give your channel a name, add an icon, and invite members. As the channel owner, defining permissions and roles is entirely up to you.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A5_LINK":"View on Microsoft Store","SUPPORT_FAQ_A5_TEXT1":"The Voxnup Windows app can be downloaded from the Microsoft Store.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A5_TEXT2":"The desktop app offers extra features such as push-to-talk, key bindings, and system notifications.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A6":"You can right-click the user's profile or use the \"Block\" or \"Report\" option from the profile card. Our moderation team will review reported content as soon as possible.","SUPPORT_FAQ_A7":"You can do these after signing in, from the &lt;strong&gt;Settings → Account Settings&lt;/strong&gt; screen. For a step-by-step walkthrough with screenshots, check the &lt;a href=\"#rehberler\" class=\"text-primary fw-medium\"&gt;Step-by-Step Guides&lt;/a&gt; section.","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q1":"How do I sign up for Voxnup?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q2":"My voice isn't reaching the other side, what should I do?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q3":"I forgot my password, how do I reset it?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q4":"How do I create my own server / channel?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q5":"How do I download the desktop app?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q6":"How do I report or block a user?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q7":"How do I delete my account or change my password?","SUPPORT_FAQ_Q8":"How does my channel appear in Discover?","SUPPORT_FAQ_A8":"To be listed on the Discover page, two conditions are required: (1) your channel must have &lt;strong&gt;at least 100 members&lt;/strong&gt;, and (2) your channel must be verified by our team as the &lt;strong&gt;official channel&lt;/strong&gt; of that community. When both are met, your channel appears in Discover automatically. To apply for official channel verification, contact our support team.","SUPPORT_FAQ_SUBTITLE":"Quick answers to the most common questions","SUPPORT_FAQ_TITLE":"Frequently Asked Questions","SUPPORT_FEEDBACK_BUTTON":"Send Feedback","SUPPORT_FEEDBACK_PROMPT":"Found a bug or have a suggestion?","SUPPORT_GUIDE_BADGE":"VISUAL GUIDE","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP2_ALT":"Danger Zone and Remove Account button","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP2_DESC":"Scroll to the &lt;strong&gt;Danger Zone&lt;/strong&gt; section at the bottom of the &lt;strong&gt;Account Settings&lt;/strong&gt; screen and click the red &lt;strong&gt;Remove Account&lt;/strong&gt; button.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP2_TITLE":"\"Danger Zone\" → Remove Account","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP3_ALT":"Account deletion warning screen","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP3_DESC":"In the dialog that opens, carefully read the consequences of deleting your account. If you're sure, press the &lt;strong&gt;I Understand, Continue&lt;/strong&gt; button. If you change your mind, you can click &lt;strong&gt;Cancel&lt;/strong&gt;.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP3_TITLE":"Read the warnings and continue","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP4_ALT":"Account deletion password confirmation screen","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP4_DESC":"In the final step, enter your &lt;strong&gt;password&lt;/strong&gt; for security and click the &lt;strong&gt;Permanently Delete My Account&lt;/strong&gt; button. Your account is permanently deleted after this step.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_STEP4_TITLE":"Enter your password and confirm","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_TITLE":"How do I delete my account?","SUPPORT_GUIDE_DELETE_WARNING":"When you delete your account, your friend lists, channel memberships, and profile information are permanently deleted. Be sure before you continue.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_INTRO":"After signing in, you can update your password from your account settings. If you don't remember your password, use the &lt;a href=\"/reset-password\" class=\"text-primary fw-medium\"&gt;Forgot Password&lt;/a&gt; link on the login screen instead.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_STEP2_ALT":"Account Information and Change Password button","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_STEP2_DESC":"Scroll to the &lt;strong&gt;Account Information&lt;/strong&gt; section on the &lt;strong&gt;Account Settings&lt;/strong&gt; screen and press the &lt;strong&gt;Change Password&lt;/strong&gt; button.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_STEP2_TITLE":"Click the \"Change Password\" button","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_STEP3_ALT":"Password change form","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_STEP3_DESC":"In the dialog that opens, enter your &lt;strong&gt;current password&lt;/strong&gt;, then your &lt;strong&gt;new password twice&lt;/strong&gt;, and click &lt;strong&gt;Save&lt;/strong&gt;. Done!","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_STEP3_TITLE":"Enter your new password and save","SUPPORT_GUIDE_PW_TITLE":"How do I change my password?","SUPPORT_GUIDE_SHOT_SETTINGS_ALT":"Opening the settings menu","SUPPORT_GUIDE_STEP_OPEN_SETTINGS_DESC":"Click your profile picture in the bottom-left corner and select &lt;strong&gt;Settings&lt;/strong&gt; from the menu.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_STEP_OPEN_SETTINGS_TITLE":"Open Settings","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_INTRO":"You can build your own community on Voxnup in minutes. Create a channel, arrange its ready-made rooms, and invite your friends.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP1_ALT":"Create Channel dialog and template options","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP1_DESC":"Click the &lt;strong&gt;+&lt;/strong&gt; (plus) button at the bottom of the channel bar on the left. In the &lt;strong&gt;Create Channel&lt;/strong&gt; dialog, pick a template: &lt;strong&gt;Empty Template&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Gaming Channel&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Community Channel&lt;/strong&gt;. Templates start your channel with ready-made rooms; you can change them all later.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP1_TITLE":"Open Create Channel and pick a template","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP2_ALT":"Channel name, description, and privacy setting form","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP2_DESC":"Enter your channel's &lt;strong&gt;name&lt;/strong&gt; and, optionally, a &lt;strong&gt;description&lt;/strong&gt; and cover image. When &lt;strong&gt;Public Channel&lt;/strong&gt; is on, your channel is discoverable; turn it off and it can only be joined with an invite link. Then click &lt;strong&gt;Create Channel&lt;/strong&gt;.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP2_TITLE":"Name your channel and add a description","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP3_ALT":"The created channel and its automatic rooms","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP3_DESC":"Your channel is ready and added to the left bar. Based on the template you chose, &lt;strong&gt;text&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;voice&lt;/strong&gt; rooms are created automatically (such as Announcements, Introductions, Events, and General Voice). You can add new rooms and categories with the &lt;strong&gt;+&lt;/strong&gt; icons.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP3_TITLE":"Your channel is ready to use","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP4_ALT":"Channel menu and the Invite to Channel option","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP4_DESC":"Click the &lt;strong&gt;⋯&lt;/strong&gt; (three dots) menu next to the channel name and choose &lt;strong&gt;Invite to Channel&lt;/strong&gt;.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP4_TITLE":"Open the invite menu","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP5_ALT":"Invite link and the friend invite list","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP5_DESC":"Copy the &lt;strong&gt;invite link&lt;/strong&gt; and share it anywhere (the link is valid for 7 days), or press the &lt;strong&gt;+ Invite&lt;/strong&gt; button next to your friends in the list. You can adjust the link's expiry from &lt;strong&gt;Edit invite link&lt;/strong&gt;.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_STEP5_TITLE":"Invite your friends","SUPPORT_GUIDE_CHANNEL_TITLE":"How do I create a channel (community) and invite friends?","SUPPORT_GUIDE_SUBTITLE":"Follow the most common account actions with screenshots.","SUPPORT_GUIDE_TITLE":"Step-by-Step Guides","SUPPORT_HERO_BADGE":"Early Access Release","SUPPORT_HERO_SUBTITLE":"Find answers, browse guides, or reach out to us directly.","SUPPORT_HERO_TITLE":"How can we help?","SUPPORT_SEARCH_PLACEHOLDER":"Search a topic... (e.g. account, audio settings, connection)","TAB_CHAT_DESC":"Find and add your friends. Chat and play games with them. Have fun sending them various GIFs and emojis.","TAB_CREATE_COMMUNITY_DESC":"Create your own community and invite your friends. Have fun playing different games in your community. Create different rooms in your community and invite people.","TAB_JOIN_CHANNELS_DESC":"Join community channels and meet new people. Chat and play games with them. Have fun playing different games in community channels.","TAB_START_FUN_DESC":"Is everything ready? Then start having fun. Chat or play games with your friends. Join community channels and meet new people.","TERMS":"Terms","THEME_DARK":"Dark","THEME_LIGHT":"Light","TOGGLE_MENU":"Toggle menu","USEFUL_LINKS":"Useful Links","USERS_JOIN_TEXT":"We reach more users every day. We'd love to have a gem like you among us. Join now and have fun with us.","BLOG_POSTS_EMPTY":"No blog posts published yet.","BLOG_POSTS_TITLE":"Blog Posts","VOXNUP_NEWS":"Voxnup News","POLICY_PAGE_H1":"Terms of Use and Privacy Policy","POLICY_LAST_UPDATED":"Last updated: November 14, 2026","POLICY_PREV_VERSION_LINK":"Previous version (October 24, 2026)","POLICY_SEO_DESC":"Voxnup Terms of Use and Privacy Policy — learn how your data is collected, processed and protected.","POLICY_SEO_KEYWORDS":"voxnup, privacy policy, terms of use, gdpr, data protection","POLICY_S1_TITLE":"1. Data Controller and Scope","POLICY_S2_TITLE":"2. User Data and Privacy","POLICY_S3_TITLE":"3. Cookies","POLICY_S4_TITLE":"4. Data Subject Rights","POLICY_S5_TITLE":"5. How the Platform Works","POLICY_S6_TITLE":"6. Community Guidelines and Prohibited Content","POLICY_S7_TITLE":"7. Reporting Content, Blocking Users and Moderation","POLICY_S8_TITLE":"8. User Content and Intellectual Property","POLICY_S9_TITLE":"9. Security and Account Responsibility","POLICY_S10_TITLE":"10. Terms of Use and Service Warranty","POLICY_S11_TITLE":"11. Disputes and Governing Law","POLICY_S12_TITLE":"12. Contact and Support","POLICY_S13_TITLE":"13. Account and Data Deletion","POLICY_P1_1":"1.1. Voxnup (the “Platform”) is developed and operated by a team without separate legal personality (the “Voxnup Team”). Under the Turkish Personal Data Protection Law No. 6698 (“KVKK”), the &lt;strong&gt;data controller is the Voxnup Team&lt;/strong&gt;.","POLICY_P1_2":"1.2. The data controller can be reached at &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\"&gt;support@voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt;. Reports of objectionable content, complaints, data subject requests and legal notices are submitted to this address. The identity and service address of the data controller are disclosed upon a lawful request by the data subject or upon the request of competent judicial and administrative authorities.","POLICY_P1_3":"1.3. This document constitutes both the &lt;strong&gt;Terms of Use&lt;/strong&gt; (end user license agreement) and the &lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt; of the Voxnup Platform, and applies to all Voxnup services including the website, the mobile applications and the desktop application.","POLICY_P1_4":"1.4. By registering, signing in or otherwise using the Platform, you represent that you have read and accepted this document. If you do not accept it, you may not use the Platform.","POLICY_P2_1":"2.1. We don’t ask for your date of birth when you sign up; instead you’re asked to &lt;strong&gt;confirm that you are over 13&lt;/strong&gt;, and the time of that confirmation is recorded. Your date of birth is asked for only once, when you first try to enter an age-restricted (18+) channel or room, to verify that you are old enough for that content; it isn’t shown on your profile and you can’t change it later (corrections go through support). Some versions of the mobile app may ask for your date of birth at sign-up; in that case it is used for the same purposes. Users under 13 may not use the Voxnup Platform; if we find that a user under 13 has signed up, the account is permanently deleted.","POLICY_P2_2":"2.2. Users’ e-mail addresses are used for account verification, important notifications, platform changes and announcements. This information is not used for any other purpose.","POLICY_P2_3":"2.3. User messages are stored on the Voxnup Platform servers and may be subject to automated checks aimed at detecting unlawful activity and the violations listed in Section 6.","POLICY_P2_4":"2.4. Conversations held in voice and video chats are not recorded or stored.","POLICY_P2_5":"2.5. Users’ IP addresses are retained upon sign-in in order to fulfil legal obligations under Turkish Law No. 5651 and, where necessary, to report to judicial and administrative authorities.","POLICY_P2_6":"2.6. All user data is hosted in data centers within the Republic of Türkiye. The following third-party service providers, which also operate outside Türkiye, are used for the purposes below, and the related data may be processed on their infrastructure: Google Firebase for SMS phone verification (2.9) and mobile notifications; Google, Apple, Microsoft or Meta (Facebook) for signing in with a social account, if you choose to (2.11); and Google Tag Manager and Google Ads for ad conversion measurement on public marketing and sign-up pages (3.2).","POLICY_P2_7":"2.7. &lt;strong&gt;Retention periods:&lt;/strong&gt;","POLICY_L2_7":"&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IP and traffic records:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;2 years&lt;/strong&gt;, pursuant to Turkish Law No. 5651.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-mail address:&lt;/strong&gt; retained for as long as the account remains open. If the account was closed for a breach of the community guidelines, it is retained &lt;strong&gt;indefinitely&lt;/strong&gt; in order to prevent re-registration with the same address.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Messages:&lt;/strong&gt; anonymised when the account is deleted and remain on the Platform.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports and moderation records:&lt;/strong&gt; retained to preserve the integrity of the moderation history, even if the reported content has been removed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phone number:&lt;/strong&gt; the number itself is not stored; only its encrypted digest (hash) and last 4 digits are kept until the user removes the number or deletes the account.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact numbers:&lt;/strong&gt; not stored. The encrypted digest of an invited number is deleted once the invited person verifies that number; invitations older than 90 days are not used for automatic friendship.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date of birth and age-13 confirmation:&lt;/strong&gt; kept while your account is open; the date of birth is deleted when you delete your account.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social sign-in link:&lt;/strong&gt; kept while your account is open; deleted when you delete your account or through a Meta data deletion request.&lt;/li&gt;","POLICY_P2_8":"2.8. When a user deletes their account:","POLICY_L2_8":"&lt;li&gt;Messages remain on the Platform in anonymised form.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The username, profile picture and other identifying information are permanently deleted.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The e-mail address and IP addresses continue to be retained for the periods set out in Section 2.7.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Voxnup reserves the right to decide, in certain circumstances, whether the user may register again.&lt;/li&gt;","POLICY_P2_9":"2.9. &lt;strong&gt;Phone number (optional):&lt;/strong&gt; A user may add a phone number to their account, verified by SMS, so that people in their contacts can find them. The verification SMS is sent through the Google Firebase Authentication service, and the number is transmitted to Google for this purpose. Voxnup servers do not store the number itself; only an irreversible encrypted digest (hash) and the last 4 digits (for display) are kept. The user may remove the number or turn off being discoverable through contact matching at any time in the settings; the number data is also deleted when the account is deleted.","POLICY_P2_10":"2.10. &lt;strong&gt;Contacts (optional, mobile app only):&lt;/strong&gt; When the “Find from Contacts” feature is used, the phone numbers in the device’s contacts are matched against the server, with the user’s permission, to find people who use Voxnup. The numbers are processed only during this matching and are not stored; contact names and other contact details never leave the device. When the user invites someone with “Invite”, the invitation is sent from the user’s own messaging app; only the encrypted digest of the invited number is stored, so that the invited person can be added as a friend automatically when they sign up (see 2.7). Contacts permission can be revoked at any time in the device settings.","POLICY_P2_11":"2.11. &lt;strong&gt;Signing in with a social account (optional):&lt;/strong&gt; You can sign up or sign in with your Google, Apple, Microsoft or Facebook account. Sign-in happens on the provider’s own page; Voxnup never sees or receives your password with that provider. We receive only your account’s unique identifier at that provider, your name, and the email address the provider has verified; if the provider hasn’t verified the email, or you don’t grant email permission, we don’t receive it. The profile photo link the provider sends is not stored, and we don’t receive your contacts, posts or other data held by the provider. This information is used to recognize you, create your account, and link it to an existing Voxnup account with the same email address. If you choose “Hide My Email” with Apple, Apple’s relay address is used. The link record (provider and identifier) is kept while your account is open and deleted when you delete your account. Facebook users can request deletion of the link by removing Voxnup in their Facebook settings; Meta forwards this request to Voxnup and the link record is deleted.","POLICY_P3_1":"3.1. The Voxnup Platform uses only the &lt;strong&gt;strictly necessary cookies&lt;/strong&gt; required for the service to function:","POLICY_L3_1":"&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Session cookie:&lt;/strong&gt; maintains the signed-in user’s session.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language preference cookie:&lt;/strong&gt; remembers your chosen interface language for 1 year.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social sign-in security cookie:&lt;/strong&gt; kept for at most 10 minutes while signing in with Apple, Microsoft or Facebook, to block forged sign-in requests.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cookie preference cookie:&lt;/strong&gt; remembers for 1 year whether you consented to advertising cookies.&lt;/li&gt;","POLICY_P3_2":"3.2. The app itself (the screens after you sign in) uses no advertising, profiling or third-party analytics cookies. On public marketing pages (home, discover, blog, support) and on the sign-up and invite pages, &lt;strong&gt;Google Tag Manager and the Google Ads conversion tag&lt;/strong&gt; are used to measure sign-ups coming from ad campaigns. These tags are loaded &lt;strong&gt;only if you give consent in the cookie banner&lt;/strong&gt;; if you don’t, they are not loaded at all. Once loaded, they may set Google cookies and report the sign-up event to Google. You can change your choice at any time via the &lt;a href=\"/support?cerez-tercihleri\"&gt;cookie preferences&lt;/a&gt; link. When you use a social sign-in button, the provider (e.g. Google) may use its own cookies on its own site.","POLICY_P3_3":"3.3. Cookies may be deleted or blocked through your browser settings. If strictly necessary cookies are blocked, you will not be able to sign in to the Platform.","POLICY_P4_1":"4.1. Pursuant to Article 11 of the KVKK, every user has the right to: learn whether their personal data is being processed; request information if it has been processed; learn the purpose of processing and whether the data is used in accordance with that purpose; request rectification of incomplete or inaccurate data; request erasure or destruction of the data; request that these actions be notified to third parties; object to an adverse outcome arising from analysis carried out solely by automated systems; and claim compensation for damage arising from unlawful processing.","POLICY_P4_2":"4.2. Users residing in the European Union additionally have the rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, objection to processing and data portability under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).","POLICY_P4_3":"4.3. Requests concerning these rights must be sent from the e-mail address registered to the account to &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\"&gt;support@voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt; and are concluded &lt;strong&gt;within 30 days at the latest&lt;/strong&gt;.","POLICY_P4_4":"4.4. If a request is rejected or left unanswered, users have the right to lodge a complaint with the Turkish Personal Data Protection Board.","POLICY_P5_1":"5.1. The Voxnup Platform provides various communication services such as voice chat, text chat, screen sharing and community servers.","POLICY_P5_2":"5.2. Users are responsible for the content they create, share or publish. Voxnup is not obliged to pre-screen user-generated content; however, it reviews content reported to it in accordance with the procedure and time limits set out in Section 7 and takes the necessary action.","POLICY_P5_3":"5.3. In the Voxnup Desktop application, the games a user is currently playing and the music they are listening to may be displayed. This feature is optional and such data is not stored on the servers.","POLICY_P6_1":"6.1. Voxnup applies a &lt;strong&gt;zero tolerance policy towards objectionable content and abusive user behaviour&lt;/strong&gt;. Everyone who uses the Platform is deemed to have accepted these rules.","POLICY_P6_2":"6.2. The following content and behaviour are strictly prohibited:","POLICY_L6_2":"&lt;li&gt;Harassment, bullying, threats, insults and systematic attacks against individuals or groups;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hate speech and discrimination based on race, ethnic origin, religion, gender, sexual orientation or disability;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Content that glorifies, encourages or incites violence;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Obscene and pornographic content; any content relating to the sexual abuse of children;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Impersonation, fraud, phishing and misleading content;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spam, unsolicited bulk messaging and behaviour intended to disrupt the operation of the Platform;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Any content or activity that is unlawful, dangerous or contrary to applicable legislation.&lt;/li&gt;","POLICY_P6_3":"6.3. Content that violates these rules is removed without prior notice.","POLICY_P6_4":"6.4. Depending on the severity of the violation, the account of a user who breaches these rules is suspended or &lt;strong&gt;permanently closed and the user is ejected from the Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Voxnup reserves the right to prevent such users from registering again.","POLICY_P6_5":"6.5. A user whose account has been suspended or closed may request a review of the decision by contacting &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\"&gt;support@voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt;.","POLICY_P6_6":"6.6. By registering, signing in or otherwise using the Voxnup Platform, the user represents that they have read and accepted these Terms of Use and the community guidelines in this Section. A user who does not accept these rules may not use the Platform.","POLICY_P7_1":"7.1. &lt;strong&gt;Reporting content.&lt;/strong&gt; Every user can report a message, a user, a room or a channel directly from within the application. A reason is selected when reporting, and a description may optionally be added.","POLICY_P7_2":"7.2. &lt;strong&gt;Blocking users.&lt;/strong&gt; Every user can block another user. The blocked user’s messages are instantly removed from the blocking user’s feed, the blocked user can no longer send messages to them, and the block is reported to Voxnup.","POLICY_P7_3":"7.3. &lt;strong&gt;The 24-hour rule.&lt;/strong&gt; Reported content is forwarded to the Voxnup moderation team and reviewed &lt;strong&gt;within 24 hours at the latest&lt;/strong&gt;.","POLICY_P7_4":"7.4. If the review establishes a breach of the rules in Section 6, the offending content is removed and the sanctions set out in Section 6.4 are applied to the user who produced it.","POLICY_P7_5":"7.5. Communications are screened by automated content control systems in order to detect unlawful activity and the violations listed in Section 6. Content flagged by these automated systems is submitted for review by the moderation team.","POLICY_P7_6":"7.6. Abuse of the reporting mechanism (submitting false or deliberately misleading reports) is likewise subject to sanctions under this Section.","POLICY_P7_7":"7.7. Channel administrators may kick and ban users within their own channels. This authority does not remove Voxnup’s moderation obligations under this Section.","POLICY_P8_1":"8.1. Content created, shared or published by a user on the Platform remains the property of that user. Voxnup claims no ownership over such content.","POLICY_P8_2":"8.2. By uploading content to the Platform, the user grants Voxnup a &lt;strong&gt;royalty-free, non-exclusive&lt;/strong&gt; licence limited to providing the service, and to storing, transmitting, backing up and displaying the content to the relevant users. This licence is used solely to operate the Platform; content is not used for advertising, sale or transfer to third parties.","POLICY_P8_3":"8.3. This licence terminates when the user deletes the content or their account. Messages that remain on the Platform in anonymised form pursuant to Section 2.8 are an exception to this provision.","POLICY_P8_4":"8.4. The Voxnup name, logo, interface and software belong to the Voxnup Team. Users may not reverse engineer, reproduce or create derivative works from the Voxnup software.","POLICY_P8_5":"8.5. Copyright infringement claims are reported to &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\"&gt;support@voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt; and reviewed in accordance with the procedure in Section 7.","POLICY_P9_1":"9.1. User data is never shared with third-party platforms or individuals. However, information such as conversations on the platform and the channels you have joined can be viewed with external applications by the administrator of a channel you have joined. This, including your activity on the platform and your online status, is solely under the control of the channel you have joined. The only exceptions to this rule are the technical service providers used to deliver the service: Google Firebase for SMS verification and notifications, social sign-in providers if you choose to use them, and Google Ads for ad conversion measurement on marketing pages (see 2.6, 2.9, 2.11 and 3.2).","POLICY_P9_2":"9.2. Users are responsible for the consequences of sharing their Platform-related information with third parties or applications.","POLICY_P9_3":"9.3. Users are responsible for the security and protection of their own accounts.","POLICY_P9_4":"9.4. Users are obliged to notify Voxnup immediately through the stated contact channels if their account is compromised. Password change requests may only be submitted with confirmation from the e-mail address registered to the account.","POLICY_P10_1":"10.1. The Voxnup Platform does not currently process any purchases. This feature may be added in the future.","POLICY_P10_2":"10.2. Voxnup reserves the right to modify, suspend or entirely discontinue the services it provides.","POLICY_P10_3":"10.3. Voxnup does not guarantee uninterrupted service.","POLICY_P10_4":"10.4. Voxnup is not liable for any data loss or disruption experienced by users.","POLICY_P10_5":"10.5. These terms of use may be amended at any time; changes are announced through in-app notifications or social media accounts.","POLICY_P11_1":"11.1. This document and the use of the Platform are governed by &lt;strong&gt;the laws of the Republic of Türkiye&lt;/strong&gt;.","POLICY_P11_2":"11.2. The courts and enforcement offices of the Republic of Türkiye have jurisdiction over any disputes that may arise.","POLICY_P11_3":"11.3. For users qualifying as consumers, the provisions on the jurisdiction of consumer arbitration committees and consumer courts are reserved.","POLICY_P11_4":"11.4. For users residing in the European Union, the mandatory provisions of the consumer legislation of their country of residence are reserved.","POLICY_P12_INTRO":"Users may submit complaints and support requests, including reports of objectionable content, through the following contact channels:","POLICY_L12":"&lt;li&gt;E-mail: &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\"&gt;support@voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Official Instagram account: &lt;a href=\"https://instagram.com/Voxnup\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;@Voxnup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;","POLICY_P13_1":"13.1. Users may delete their account and the personal data associated with it at any time:","POLICY_L13_1":"&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From within the app:&lt;/strong&gt; In the mobile or web application, follow &lt;em&gt;Settings &amp;rarr; Delete Account&lt;/em&gt; to delete your account directly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By e-mail:&lt;/strong&gt; You may send a deletion request from the e-mail address registered to your account to &lt;a href=\"mailto:support@voxnup.com\"&gt;support@voxnup.com&lt;/a&gt;. Requests are processed within &lt;strong&gt;30 days&lt;/strong&gt; at the latest.&lt;/li&gt;","POLICY_P13_2":"13.2. When an account is deleted, the rules in Section 2.8 apply: the username, profile picture and identifying information are permanently deleted; messages are anonymised; the e-mail address and IP addresses are retained for the periods set out in Section 2.7.","POLICY_P13_3":"13.3. Since voice and video chat conversations are not recorded (Section 2.4), there are no audio or video recordings to delete.","AGE_RESTRICTED_BADGE":"18+","AGE_RESTRICTED_GATE_TITLE":"Age-restricted content","AGE_RESTRICTED_GATE_DESC":"This channel contains content intended only for users aged 18 and over. Do you want to continue?","AGE_RESTRICTED_BLOCKED_TITLE":"This content is age-restricted","AGE_RESTRICTED_BLOCKED_DESC":"You cannot access this content because you are under 18.","AGE_RESTRICTED_CONTINUE":"Continue","AGE_RESTRICTED_GO_BACK":"Go Back","AGE_RESTRICTED_ACCESS_DENIED":"This content is age-restricted. You must be over 18 to access it.","AGE_RESTRICTED_NO_BIRTHDATE":"Please enter your date of birth to access age-restricted content.","VNL_PLAY":"Play","VNL_PAUSE":"Pause","VNL_MUTE":"Mute","VNL_UNMUTE":"Unmute","VNL_VOLUME":"Volume","VNL_SEEK":"Seek","VNL_FULLSCREEN":"Fullscreen","VNL_EXIT_FULLSCREEN":"Exit fullscreen","VNL_PLAYBACK_SPEED":"Playback speed","VNL_PIP":"Miniplayer","VNL_VIDEO_ERROR":"The video could not be played.","VNL_DOWNLOAD":"Download","REPORT_MESSAGE":"Report Message","REPORT_ROOM":"Report Room","REPORT_CHANNEL":"Report Channel",