"Share Settings","SHARE_SYSTEM_AUDIO":"Share computer audio","SYSTEM_AUDIO_UNAVAILABLE_HINT":"This browser or capture type doesn't support audio sharing. In Chrome, try selecting a tab or the entire screen.","SCREEN_QUALITY":"Stream Quality","SCREEN_QUALITY_SOURCE":"Source Resolution","SCREEN_FPS":"Frame Rate (FPS)","OPTIMIZE_FOR":"Optimize for","OPTIMIZE_MOTION":"Motion (gaming / video)","OPTIMIZE_DETAIL":"Clarity (text / code)","USER_LIMIT":"User Limit","USER_LIMIT_HINT":"Maximum number of users that can be in the voice room at the same time. The channel owner and members with the move members permission can bypass the limit.","USER_LIMIT_UNLIMITED":"Unlimited","VOICE_ROOM_FULL_NOTICE":"The voice room is full. You cannot join because the user limit has been reached.","OPEN_TEXT_CHAT":"Open Chat","AFK_WARNING_TITLE":"Are you there?","AFK_WARNING_TEXT":"No voice activity for a while. You will be removed from the voice room in %s seconds unless you respond.","AFK_IM_HERE":"I'm here","AFK_KICKED_NOTICE":"You were removed from the voice room due to inactivity.","STAGE":"Stage","STAGE_DESC":"Stage room: only speakers broadcast, listeners raise their hand to request to speak","RAISE_HAND":"Raise Hand","LOWER_HAND":"Lower Hand","APPROVE_SPEAKER":"Make speaker","MOVE_TO_AUDIENCE":"Move to audience","STAGE_PROMOTED_NOTICE":"You are now a speaker. Your microphone is available.","STAGE_DEMOTED_NOTICE":"You were moved to the audience. Raise your hand to request to speak.","STAGE_LISTENER_SPEAK_HINT":"Your voice is not being transmitted. Raise your hand to request to speak.","STAGE_HAND_RAISED":"Requesting to speak","START_VOICE_CALL":"Start voice call","START_VIDEO_CALL":"Start video call","INCOMING_VIDEO_CALL":"Incoming Video Call","ABOUT_ME":"About Me","ABOUT_ME_PLACEHOLDER":"Tell others a bit about yourself","BANNER_IMAGE":"Banner Image","CHANGE_BANNER":"Change Banner","REMOVE_BANNER":"Remove Banner","BANNER_WILL_BE_REMOVED":"Your banner image will be removed!","CONFIRM_REMOVE_BANNER":"Are you sure you want to remove your banner image?","BANNER_SAVE_ERROR":"Banner image could not be saved.","DOWNLOAD_MY_DATA":"Download My Data","DOWNLOAD_MY_DATA_DESCRIPTION":"Download a copy of your account data as a JSON file. Includes your profile, settings, messages, friends and login history.","EXPORT_PREPARING":"Preparing your data, this may take a moment...","EXPORT_RATE_LIMITED":"You have requested your data too many times. Please try again tomorrow.","EXPORT_ERROR":"Your data could not be exported.","TWO_FACTOR_AUTH":"Two-Factor Authentication","TWO_FACTOR_DESCRIPTION":"Adds a second lock to your account by asking for a code from an authenticator app alongside your password.","TWO_FACTOR_STATUS_ON":"On","TWO_FACTOR_STATUS_OFF":"Off","TWO_FACTOR_ENABLE":"Enable","TWO_FACTOR_DISABLE":"Disable","TWO_FACTOR_SCAN_QR":"Scan this QR code with your authenticator app (Google Authenticator, Authy, 1Password...).","TWO_FACTOR_MANUAL_KEY":"If you cannot scan the QR code, enter this key manually:","TWO_FACTOR_ENTER_CODE":"Enter the 6-digit code from the app:","TWO_FACTOR_CODE":"Verification Code","TWO_FACTOR_REQUIRED":"A two-factor authentication code is required.","TWO_FACTOR_INVALID_CODE":"Invalid code. Please try again.","TWO_FACTOR_SESSION_EXPIRED":"Verification timed out. Please sign in again.","ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED":"Your account has been suspended. Reason: %s","ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED_UNTIL":"Your account is suspended until %s. Reason: %s","TWO_FACTOR_ALREADY_ENABLED":"Two-factor authentication is already enabled.","TWO_FACTOR_SETUP_FIRST":"You need to start the setup first.","TWO_FACTOR_ENABLED":"Two-factor authentication enabled.","TWO_FACTOR_DISABLED":"Two-factor authentication disabled.","TWO_FACTOR_DISABLE_CONFIRM":"Enter your password to disable two-factor authentication:","TWO_FACTOR_LOGIN_HINT":"Enter the code from your authenticator app or one of your recovery codes.","RECOVERY_CODES":"Recovery Codes","RECOVERY_CODES_DESCRIPTION":"If you lose your phone, these codes are the only way back into your account. Each code works once. Save them somewhere safe now — they will not be shown again after you close this screen.","RECOVERY_CODES_LEFT":"You have %s recovery codes left.","COPY":"Copy","COPIED":"Copied.","VERIFY":"Verify","WRONG_PASSWORD":"Incorrect password.","TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS":"Too many attempts. Please wait a moment and try again.","NEW_MESSAGES":"New messages","VOICE_MESSAGE":"Voice message","ROLE_DELETED":"Role deleted.","ROLE_DELETE_ERROR":"Role could not be deleted.","STATIC_ROLE_CANNOT_BE_DELETED":"The default role (@everyone) cannot be deleted.","NO_PERM_MANAGE_ROLES":"You do not have permission to manage roles.","NO_PERM_MANAGE_ROOMS":"You do not have permission to manage rooms.","NO_PERM_MANAGE_CHANNEL":"You do not have permission to manage this channel.","NO_PERM_CREATE_INVITE":"You do not have permission to create invites for this channel.","CHANNEL_INVITE_ONLY":"You can only join this channel with an invite link.","VOICE_PREJOIN_TITLE":"You're joining a voice room","VOICE_PREJOIN_HINT":"Check your microphone and camera before joining.","VOICE_PREJOIN_JOIN":"Join Room","VOICE_PREJOIN_CAMERA_OFF":"Camera off","VOICE_PREJOIN_MIC_DENIED":"Microphone unavailable. You can join muted or grant access and try again.","VOICE_PREJOIN_CAMERA_DENIED":"Camera unavailable.","VOICE_PREJOIN_MIC":"Microphone","VOICE_PREJOIN_CAMERA":"Camera","FRIEND_REQUEST_PENDING":"Friend request pending","THIS_IS_YOUR_PROFILE":"This is your profile","GO_TO_ROOMS":"Go to Rooms","UPLOAD_FILE":"Upload File","SEARCH_MESSAGES":"Search Messages","STARRED_MESSAGES":"Starred Messages","SHOW_USER_INFO":"User Info","SOUNDBOARD":"Soundboard","FULL_SCREEN":"Full Screen","EXIT_FULL_SCREEN":"Exit Full Screen","CHANNEL_DISCOVERY":"Discover Communities","ADD_CHANNEL":"Add Channel","DEVELOPER_ROOM":"Developer Room","CLOSE_PREVIEW":"Close Preview","LINK_PREVIEW":"Link preview","REMOVE_IMAGE":"Remove Image","MORE_OPTIONS":"More Options","OPEN_CHANNEL_MENU":"Channel Menu","ERR_DISCRIMINATOR_VALIDATION":"Invalid user tag. It must be a 4-digit number.","FAVORITES":"Favorites","ADD_FRIEND_HINT":"Enter the username of the person you want to add and send the request.","SEARCH_COMMUNITY":"Search Communities","SUPPORT_US":"Support Us","UNREAD":"Unread","ACCEPT":"Accept","REJECT":"Decline","VOICE_TAG":"Voice","HOME_FAVORITES_EMPTY":"Right-click a room and add it to your favorites.","HOME_FREQUENT_EMPTY":"Send messages or join voice chats; the rooms you use most will show up here.","USER_INFO":"User info","YOUR_FRIEND":"Your friend","AUDIO_DEVICES":"Devices","SETTINGS_GENERAL":"General","SHORTCUTS":"Shortcuts","INTERFACE_LANGUAGE":"Interface language","ACTIVITY_SHARING":"Activity sharing","UNSAVED_CHANGES":"You have unsaved changes.","RESET":"Reset","CLOSE_SETTINGS":"Close settings","NOT_ASSIGNED":"Not assigned","CUSTOM_COLOR":"Custom color","DISPLAY_NAME_HELP":"Between 2 and 32 characters.","STATUS_MESSAGE_HELP":"Shown above your name on your profile.","AVATAR_HELP":"JPG or PNG, up to 10 MB, must be square.","BANNER_COLOR_HELP":"Your profile card's background when there's no banner image.","BANNER_IMAGE_HELP":"JPG, PNG or WEBP, up to 10 MB.","ACCOUNT_REMOVAL_HELP":"Permanently removes your account. This can't be undone.","INPUT_RANGE_HELP":"Your microphone opens when your voice rises above this level.","STREAMER_MODE_HELP":"While on, desktop notifications, notification sounds and unread badges are hidden.","SHARE_ACTIVITY_HELP":"While off, the games you play and the music you listen to aren't shown to your friends.","KEYBIND_TOGGLE_MUTE":"Toggle microphone","KEYBIND_TOGGLE_DEAFEN":"Toggle deafen","KEYBIND_OPEN":"Open key bindings","KEYBIND_TEST":"Test","KEYBIND_EDIT":"Change the %s shortcut","KEY_SCOPE_IN_CALL":"In a call","KEY_SCOPE_HOLD":"In a call, while held","KEY_SCOPE_IN_APP":"In the app","PARTICIPANTS":"Participants","PARTICIPANTS_PANEL":"Participants panel","IN_ROOM":"In the room","PARTICIPANT_COUNT":"%s people","DURATION_HOURS_MINUTES":"%s h %s min","DURATION_MINUTES":"%s min","STATUS_SCREEN_SHARING":"Sharing screen","STATUS_CAMERA_ON":"Camera on","STATUS_SPEAKING":"Speaking","STATUS_MIC_OFF":"Mic off","STATUS_LISTENING":"Listening","YOU_TAG":"YOU","YOU_SUFFIX":"you","LIVE_TAG":"LIVE","SCREEN_LABEL":"Screen","LEAVE_ROOM":"Leave","VOICE_CONTROLS":"Voice controls","MIC_OPTIONS":"Microphone options","INVITE_TO_ROOM":"Invite to room","SOUNDBOARD_HINT":"Everyone in the room hears it","GRID_VIEW":"Grid view","FOCUS_VIEW":"Focus view","USER_VOLUME_OF":"%s volume","VOICE_PUBLISH_FAILED":"Couldn't start your voice stream.","CALL":"Call","MINIMIZE_CALL":"Minimize call","CANCEL_CALL":"Cancel","CALL_KIND_VOICE":"Voice call","CALL_KIND_VIDEO":"Video call","JOIN_VOICE":"Join with voice","JOIN_VIDEO":"Video","MESSAGE_INSTEAD":"Send a message instead","CALLING_USER":"Calling %s…","CALLING_YOU":"is calling you","CALLING_GROUP":"%s is calling the group","VOICE_CALL":"Voice call","VIDEO_CALL":"Video call","IN_CALL":"In a call","PRIVATE_CALL":"Private call","CALLING":"Calling…","RINGING_USER":"Ringing %s…","RINGING":"Ringing…","CALL_MSG_VOICE":"Voice call","CALL_MSG_VIDEO":"Video call","CALL_MSG_RINGING":"%s started","CALL_MSG_ONGOING":"%s in progress","CALL_MSG_ENDED":"%s ended · %s","CALL_MSG_ENDED_NODUR":"%s ended","CALL_MSG_NO_ANSWER":"%s not answered","CALL_MSG_MISSED_VOICE":"Missed voice call","CALL_MSG_MISSED_VIDEO":"Missed video call","CALL_MSG_DECLINED":"%s declined","DURATION_HOUR":"%s h","DURATION_MIN":"%s min","DURATION_SEC":"%s s","CS_TITLE":"Channel Settings","CS_TAB_MEMBERS":"Members","CS_TAB_AUDIT":"Audit Log","CS_TAB_BANS":"Bans","CS_CHANGE_BANNER":"Change Banner","CS_BRAND_SPEC":"Banner 1600×500, channel image 512×512 · PNG, JPG or WEBP","CS_IDENTITY":"Identity","CS_CHANNEL_NAME":"Channel Name","CS_CHANNEL_NAME_HELP":"Between 2 and 50 characters.","CS_CHANNEL_NAME_PH":"Enter a channel name","CS_DESC_HELP":"Shown on the Discover page and on invite links.","CS_ROLES_LEAD":"Roles group members and grant permissions. A member has a permission if any of their roles has it. The channel owner has every permission.","CS_ROLES_COUNT":"Roles · %s","CS_CREATE_ROLE":"Create role","CS_UNTITLED_ROLE":"Untitled role","CS_ROLE_STATIC_NAME":"The @everyone role can't be renamed.","CS_ROLE_COLOR":"Role Color","CS_ROLE_COLOR_HELP":"Shown in the member list and on tags.","CS_DELETE_ROLE_HELP":"The role is removed from every member. This can't be undone.","CS_SEARCH_PERM":"Search permissions","CS_PERM_NO_MATCH":"No permission matches this search.","CS_SOUNDS_LEAD":"Manage the channel's sound effects · Max. 10 sounds. Everyone in the room hears sounds played from the soundboard.","CS_SELECT_SOUND":"Choose or drop a sound file","CS_LISTEN_TO":"Play %s","CS_DELETE_ITEM":"Delete %s","CS_EXPR_LIMIT":"You can add at most %s items of this type.","CS_MEMBERS_LEAD":"Manage the roles of channel members. Everyone has the @everyone role; it can't be removed from a member.","CS_OWNER":"Owner","CS_REMOVE_ROLE":"Remove the %s role","CS_MORE_FOR":"More actions for %s","CS_NO_ROLES_LEFT":"No roles left to add.","CS_TIMEOUT_FOR":"Time Out — %s","CS_MIN_5":"5 minutes","CS_MIN_10":"10 minutes","CS_HOUR_1":"1 hour","CS_HOUR_24":"24 hours","CS_WEEK_1":"1 week","CS_BAN_TEXT":"%s will be banned from the channel. Banned users can't rejoin, not even with an invite.","CS_BAN_REASON":"Reason for the ban","CS_JOIN":"Joining","CS_AGE_DESC":"The channel's content is only visible to users over 18. Users confirm their age before joining.","CS_AUDIT_LEAD":"Who changed what in the channel, newest first.","CS_YESTERDAY_AT":"Yesterday %s","CS_BANS_LEAD":"Banned users can't join the channel, not even with an invite. To ban someone, right-click them in the channel.","CS_SEARCH_BANNED":"Search banned users","CS_REASON":"Reason:","CS_UNBAN":"Revoke Ban","CS_UNBAN_CONFIRM":"Are you sure you want to revoke this user's ban?","CS_DELETE_TITLE":"The channel will be deleted","CS_DELETE_TEXT":"Are you sure you want to delete the channel? All rooms, messages, roles and media are deleted permanently. This can't be undone.","CS_DELETE_MATCH":"Type the channel's name to confirm:","CS_ROLE_ORDER":"Role order","CS_ROLE_ORDER_SAVED":"Role order saved.","ERR_TARGET_RANK":"You can't do this to yourself, the channel owner, or someone with a role equal to or higher than yours.","ERR_ROLE_RANK":"You can only manage roles below your highest role.","ERR_GRANT_OWN_PERM":"You can't grant a permission you don't have.","NO_VOICE_MESSAGE_PERMISSION":"You don't have permission to send voice messages in this room.","CS_ROLE_DRAG_HINT":"Drag roles to reorder them. Higher roles rank above lower ones: people who manage roles can only edit roles below their own.","CS_ROLE_LOCKED":"This role is equal to or higher than your highest role; you can't edit it.","PHONE_VERIFY_FAILED":"Phone could not be verified. Request a new code and try again.","PHONE_ALREADY_REGISTERED":"An account with this number already exists. Sign in or reset your password via SMS.","PHONE_NOT_REGISTERED":"No account is linked to this number.","PHONE_REMOVE_NEEDS_EMAIL":"Your account has no email; this number is your only recovery method. Add an email address before removing it.","PHONE_SAVED":"Your phone number has been saved.","PHONE_REMOVED":"Your phone number has been removed.","PHONE_REQUIRED_FOR_CONTACTS":"Verify your own phone number first to find friends from your contacts.","PHONE_TOO_MANY_NUMBERS":"At most 500 numbers can be sent at once.","PHONE_NUMBER":"Phone Number","PHONE_NUMBER_HELP":"Let friends who have your number in their contacts find you. Your number is never shown to anyone.","PHONE_ADD":"Add Number","PHONE_REMOVE":"Remove","PHONE_REMOVE_TITLE":"Remove Number","PHONE_REMOVE_CONFIRM":"Your number will be removed from your account; people who have it in their contacts will no longer find you. You will need to verify again to add it back.","PHONE_DISCOVERABLE":"Let people find me by my number","PHONE_DISCOVERABLE_HELP":"When off, people who have your number won't see you in friend suggestions.","PHONE_VERIFY_TITLE":"Phone Number","PHONE_VERIFY_SUB":"Verify your number with the code sent by SMS.","PHONE_SMS_NOTICE":"An SMS with a one-time code will be sent to your number. Your number is not stored in plain text.","PHONE_SEND_CODE":"Send Code","PHONE_ENTER_CODE":"6-digit code","PHONE_CODE_SENT_TO":"Enter the code sent to %s.","PHONE_CHANGE_NUMBER":"Change number","PHONE_RESEND":"Resend code","PHONE_INVALID":"Enter a valid mobile phone number.","SIGNUP_PHONE_UNVERIFIED":"Your account has been created, but we could not deliver an SMS to your number, so your phone is not verified. You can sign in with your username for now and verify your number in Settings.","EMAIL_VERIFIED_SIGNED_IN":"Your email is verified and your account is ready. Welcome!","EMAIL_CHANGE_CONFIRMED":"Your email address has been updated.","PHONE_CODE_INVALID":"The code is incorrect. Check it and try again.","PHONE_CODE_EXPIRED":"The code has expired. Request a new one.","PHONE_NETWORK_ERROR":"Connection error. Check your internet and try again.","PHONE_WEB_UNAVAILABLE":"For now, you can add your phone number from the Voxnup mobile app.","DAVET_TITLE":"You're invited to Voxnup","DAVET_TEXT":"Your friend wants to talk with you on Voxnup: voice and text chat, communities. Download the app and create your account.","DAVET_GET_IOS":"Download on the App Store","DAVET_GET_ANDROID":"Get it on Google Play","DAVET_MEMBER_NOTE":"Already on Voxnup? Log in and their friend request will be waiting for you.","DAVET_LOGIN_ADD_PHONE":"Log In","DAVET_INVALID":"This invite link is invalid.","DAVET_FROM":"%s invited you to Voxnup","DAVET_AUTO_FRIEND":"When you join, their friend request will be waiting for you.","DAVET_REGISTER_WEB":"Create an Account on the Web","DAVET_CONFIRM_TEXT":"Once you're friends, you can message and call each other.","DAVET_CONFIRM_ADD":"Add Friend","DAVET_CONFIRM_SKIP":"Not Now","AUTH_OR_WITH_EMAIL":"or with email","AUTH_CONTINUE_WITH":"Continue with %s","AUTH_SOCIAL_FINISH_TITLE":"Finish your account","AUTH_SOCIAL_FINISH_LEAD":"You're continuing with your %1$s account (%s). One last step.","AUTH_SOCIAL_FINISH_LEAD_NOEMAIL":"You're continuing with your %s account. One last step.","AUTH_SOCIAL_FINISH_BUTTON":"Create Account","AUTH_TERMS_CONTINUE":"By continuing, you accept the Voxnup %s.","SOCIAL_AUTH_FAILED":"Sign-in failed. Please try again.","SOCIAL_AUTH_EXPIRED":"This took too long. Please press the sign-in button again.","SOCIAL_AUTH_CLOSE_WINDOW":"You can close this window.","AUTH_AGE_CONFIRM":"I confirm that I am over 13 years old.","AGE_CONFIRM_REQUIRED":"To continue, please confirm that you are over 13.","AGE_BIRTHDATE_TITLE":"Enter your date of birth","AGE_BIRTHDATE_DESC":"This content is for ages 18 and up. We only ask for your date of birth once; it isn’t shown on your profile and can’t be changed later.","AGE_BIRTHDATE_SAVE":"Save","BIRTHDATE_ALREADY_SET":"Your date of birth is already set. Contact support to change it.","BIRTHDATE_SAVED":"Your date of birth has been saved.","COOKIE_CONSENT_TEXT":"We use cookies to give you a better experience.","COOKIE_CONSENT_MORE":"Details","COOKIE_CONSENT_ACCEPT":"Accept","COOKIE_CONSENT_REJECT":"Reject","COOKIE_CONSENT_LABEL":"Cookie preference","AUTH_SHOW_TITLE":"Your friends are waiting.","AUTH_SHOW_TEXT":"Hop into voice rooms, share your screen and meet your community in one place.","AUTH_SHOW_ROOM":"Late Night Chat","AUTH_SHOW_LIVE":"Live","AUTH_SHOW_MSG":"Tournament tonight, who's in? 🎮","AUTH_SHOW_JOINED":"%s joined the room","AUTH_SHOW_F1":"Voice rooms","AUTH_SHOW_F2":"Screen sharing","AUTH_SHOW_F3":"Communities","SITE_SKIP":"Skip to content","SITE_THEME_TOGGLE":"Light / dark theme","SITE_NAV_CTA":"Open Voxnup","SITE_FOOT_TAGLINE":"Voice rooms, chat and games for your friends and communities. All in one place.","SITE_FOOT_PRODUCT":"Product","SITE_FOOT_HELP":"Help","SITE_FOOT_LEGAL":"Legal","SITE_HERO_EYEBROW":"Early access is open, join for free","SITE_HERO_TITLE":"Talk, play, &lt;span class=\"vs-grad\"&gt;stay together.&lt;/span&gt;","SITE_HERO_LEAD":"Bring your friends and community together with voice rooms, chat channels and screen sharing. Free, fast and nothing to install: start right in your browser.","SITE_HERO_CTA":"Start in your browser","SITE_HERO_SHOT_ALT":"The Voxnup app: channels, voice rooms and chat","SITE_HERO_TALKING":"6 people in voice","SITE_HERO_JOINED":"Mira joined the room","SITE_GAMES_LABEL":"What are your friends playing or listening to? See it in their activity and join in one click.","SITE_FEAT_TITLE":"Everything you need to hang out together","SITE_FEAT_LEAD":"From voice chat to role management, the tools you need to grow your community live in one app.","SITE_F_VOICE_T":"Crystal-clear voice rooms","SITE_F_VOICE_D":"Low-latency audio, noise suppression, push-to-talk and device selection. Hop in and start talking.","SITE_F_SCREEN_T":"Screen and camera sharing","SITE_F_SCREEN_D":"Stream your game, present your work or turn on your camera so everyone watches together.","SITE_F_CHAT_T":"Lively chat channels","SITE_F_CHAT_D":"Chat with GIFs, emoji, stickers, reactions and sound effects; pin, search and reply.","SITE_F_ROLES_T":"Roles and permissions","SITE_F_ROLES_D":"Run your channel exactly your way with categories, rooms and fine-grained permissions.","SITE_F_FRIENDS_T":"Friends and direct messages","SITE_F_FRIENDS_D":"See who's online, message privately or start a voice call in one click.","SITE_F_DEVICES_T":"On every device","SITE_F_DEVICES_D":"Browser, Windows and mobile app; pick up right where you left off.","SITE_ROW_SOCIAL_KICKER":"Hang out","SITE_COMM_KICKER":"There's a place for everyone","SITE_STAT_LANGS":"Languages","SITE_STAT_FREE_V":"$0","SITE_STAT_FREE":"Free to use","SITE_ALL_NEWS":"All announcements","SITE_CTA_TITLE":"Your room is ready. So are your friends.","SITE_CTA_LEAD":"Create your account, set up a channel and share your invite link. It all takes less than a minute.","SITE_ALL_PLATFORMS":"All platforms","SITE_PLAT_WEB":"Open in browser","SITE_BLOG_LATEST":"Latest","SITE_BLOG_READ":"Read more","SITE_BLOG_MIN_READ":"min read","SITE_BLOG_MORE":"More announcements","SITE_BLOG_COPY":"Copy link","SITE_BLOG_COPIED":"Copied","SITE_BLOG_FOLLOW_T":"Be the first to hear what's new","SITE_BLOG_FOLLOW_D":"When we publish a new announcement, we show it to you in the app. Open Voxnup and don't miss a thing.","SITE_LEGAL_TOC":"Contents","SITE_LEGAL_Q":"Have a question?","SITE_LEGAL_Q_TEXT":"Write to us about anything related to these terms or your data.","SITE_LEGAL_ARCHIVE":"Archived version","SITE_DISC_TITLE":"Find your next community","SITE_DISC_SEARCH_BTN":"Search","SITE_DISC_CATS":"Categories","SITE_DISC_EMPTY_HINT":"Try another category or search with a different word.","SITE_DISC_SEE_ALL":"All communities","SITE_DL_SEO_TITLE":"Download Voxnup: Windows, Android, iOS and web","SITE_DL_SEO_DESC":"Download Voxnup for free on Windows, Android and iOS, or use it in your browser with nothing to install.","SITE_DL_TITLE":"Voxnup &lt;span class=\"vs-grad\"&gt;on every device&lt;/span&gt;","SITE_DL_LEAD":"On your computer, your phone or right in the browser. Same account, same friends, same channels.","SITE_DL_YOURS":"Your device","SITE_DL_WIN_T":"Windows","SITE_DL_WIN_D":"The desktop app: Voxnup in its own window, one click away on your taskbar.","SITE_DL_AND_T":"Android","SITE_DL_AND_D":"Chats and voice rooms in your pocket, with instant message and call notifications.","SITE_DL_IOS_T":"iPhone and iPad","SITE_DL_IOS_D":"Stay connected wherever you are; chat and join voice rooms on the go.","SITE_DL_WEB_T":"Web browser","SITE_DL_WEB_D":"Open it and start, nothing to install. Works on any computer.","SITE_DL_WEB_BTN":"Open in browser","SITE_DL_STORE_MS":"Microsoft Store","SITE_DL_STORE_GP":"Google Play","SITE_DL_STORE_AS":"App Store","SITE_DL_SAME_T":"One account, everywhere","SITE_DL_P1":"Your friends, channels and messages are the same on all your devices.","SITE_DL_P2":"Start a conversation on your computer and continue it on your phone.","SITE_DL_P3":"The app is free; updates arrive through the store.","SITE_DL_HELP_T":"Stuck during setup?","SITE_DL_HELP_D":"The guides on our support page walk you through it step by step; if you can't find an answer, write to us.","SITE_404_TRY":"Maybe you were looking for one of these","SITE_404_BLOG_D":"What's new, updates and release notes.","SITE_404_DL_D":"Windows, Android, iOS or right in your browser.","SITE_ACT_KICKER":"Activity status","SITE_ACT_PLAYING":"Playing","SITE_ACT_LISTENING":"Listening","SITE_ACT_JOIN":"Join","TRANSFER_OWNERSHIP":"Transfer Ownership","TRANSFER_OWNERSHIP_CONFIRM":"%s will become the new owner of this channel. All channel permissions move to them and you stay as a regular member. Only they can transfer it back to you.","TRANSFER_CODE_TOTP":"Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app to confirm the transfer.","TRANSFER_CODE_EMAIL":"We sent a 6-digit code to %s. Enter it to confirm the transfer.","TRANSFER_CODE_PASSWORD":"Enter your password to confirm the transfer.","TRANSFER_CODE_LABEL":"Verification code","TRANSFER_CODE_INVALID":"The code is wrong or has expired.","TRANSFER_TARGET_INVALID":"A channel can only be transferred to one of its members.","TRANSFER_NEEDS_VERIFY_METHOD":"To transfer a channel, first add an email address or two-step verification to your account.","ONLY_OWNER_CAN_TRANSFER":"Only the channel owner can transfer it.","OWNERSHIP_TRANSFERRED":"Channel ownership was transferred to %s.","OWNERSHIP_TRANSFER_DM":"%s transferred ownership of the %s channel to you. You are now its owner.","TRANSFER_MAIL_TITLE":"Channel transfer verification code","TRANSFER_MAIL_BODY":"Here is your code to transfer the %s channel to %s. It is valid for 10 minutes.","TRANSFER_MAIL_HELP":"If you didn't start this, don't share the code with anyone and sign out of unfamiliar sessions in Settings &gt; Sessions.","CS_WELCOME_ROOM":"Join announcements","CS_WELCOME_ROOM_DESC":"New members get a playful welcome message in this room.","CS_WELCOME_OFF":"Off","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_1":"%s is here, now the party can start. 🎉","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_2":"%s parachuted onto the map. 🪂","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_3":"%s is here, everyone refill your tea. 🫖","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_4":"Welcome, %s! We hope you brought pizza. 🍕","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_5":"%s joined us. Mic check: one, two… 🎤","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_6":"%s just slipped in. Say hi before anyone notices. 👀","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_7":"Buckle up, %s has boarded the plane! ✈️","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_8":"%s is here! Cue the drums. 🥁","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_9":"%s showed up and the room lit up. 🥳","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_10":"%s teleported in. Science can't explain it yet. 🛸","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_11":"All rise! %s has entered the hall. 👑","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_12":"%s arrived. Rules are over there, cupcakes over here. 🧁","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_13":"Attention please: %s just took the stage! 🎬","CHANNEL_JOIN_MSG_14":"%s hopped in. Shake out the rug. 🐇","CS_RULES":"Rules","CS_RULES_REQUIRE":"Require new members to accept the rules","CS_RULES_REQUIRE_DESC":"New members can't send messages or join voice rooms until they accept the rules. People already in the channel when you turn this on aren't asked.","CS_RULES_TEXT":"Rules text","CS_RULES_TEXT_DESC":"Shown in the confirmation window. Up to 4000 characters.","CS_RULES_PLACEHOLDER":"1. Be respectful.\n2. No spam.\n3. No advertising.","CS_RULES_EMPTY":"Write the rules first to turn on confirmation.","CHANNEL_RULES_TITLE":"%s rules","CHANNEL_RULES_INTRO":"Read and accept the rules before you post in this channel.","CHANNEL_RULES_ACCEPT":"I've read and accept","CHANNEL_RULES_LATER":"Later","CHANNEL_RULES_ACCEPTED":"You accepted the rules. Welcome!","VOICE_RULES_PENDING":"Accept the channel rules before joining a voice room.","EXPERIMENTAL":"Experimental","EXPERIMENTAL_SHORT":"Exp","GAMES_ALL":"Games","GAMES_EXIT":"Leave game","CS_MIN_ACCOUNT_AGE":"Minimum account age","CS_MIN_ACCOUNT_AGE_DESC":"Voxnup accounts newer than this can't post in the channel. Stops freshly made spam accounts.","CS_MIN_MEMBER_AGE":"Minimum time as a member","CS_MIN_MEMBER_AGE_DESC":"New members can't post until this much time has passed since they joined, so they read first.","CS_AGE_NONE":"No limit","CS_AGE_5M":"5 minutes","CS_AGE_10M":"10 minutes","CS_AGE_1H":"1 hour","CS_AGE_1D":"1 day","CS_AGE_1W":"1 week","POST_WAIT_ACCOUNT":"Your account needs to be a bit older to post in this channel. You can post in %s.","POST_WAIT_MEMBER":"You need to be a member a little longer to post in this channel. You can post in %s.","DURATION_DAYS":"%s days","GAMES_SINGLE":"Single-player games","GAMES_MULTI":"Multiplayer games","GAMES_RANKED":"Ranked","GAME_SUDOKU":"Sudoku","GAME_SUDOKU_DESC":"4 difficulties, optional 16×16. You get 3 mistakes; finish fast for 3 stars. Your score goes to your profile.","SUDOKU_LEVEL":"Difficulty","SUDOKU_EASY":"Easy","SUDOKU_NORMAL":"Normal","SUDOKU_HARD":"Hard","SUDOKU_EXPERT":"Expert","SUDOKU_EASY_16":"Easy 16×16","SUDOKU_NORMAL_16":"Normal 16×16","SUDOKU_HARD_16":"Hard 16×16","SUDOKU_EXPERT_16":"Expert 16×16","SUDOKU_EASY_HINT":"5 min for 3★","SUDOKU_NORMAL_HINT":"10 min for 3★","SUDOKU_HARD_HINT":"15 min for 3★","SUDOKU_EXPERT_HINT":"25 min for 3★","SUDOKU_16_MODE":"16×16 mode","SUDOKU_16_MODE_DESC":"A giant board played with 1-9 and A-G. Times ×4, points ×3.","SUDOKU_START":"Start","SUDOKU_TIME":"Time","SUDOKU_MISTAKES":"Mistakes left","SUDOKU_MODE_LABEL":"Mode","SUDOKU_WON":"Solved it, well done! 🎉","SUDOKU_LOST":"3 mistakes, not this time.","SUDOKU_SCORE":"+%s points","SUDOKU_TIME_RESULT":"time %s","SUDOKU_TOTAL":"Your total game score: %s","SUDOKU_SAVED":"added to your profile","SUDOKU_AGAIN":"Play again","SUDOKU_MODES":"Choose mode","SUDOKU_STARS_HINT":"%s left to keep this star","SUDOKU_POINTS":"Number points","SUDOKU_PTS":"%s pts","SUDOKU_SOUND":"Game sounds","SUDOKU_PRAISE":"Great!|Awesome!|Masterful!|Bravo!|Brilliant!|Genius!","SUDOKU_AUTOFILL":"I'll take it from here ✨","SUDOKU_CELLS_RESULT":"%s from numbers · multiplier ×%s","SUDOKU_HARD_CELLS":"👍 You found %s tough numbers (double points)","SUDOKU_PAUSE":"Pause","SUDOKU_PAUSED":"Paused","SUDOKU_PAUSED_DESC":"The clock is stopped. Pick up where you left off when you're ready.","SUDOKU_RESUME":"Resume","SUDOKU_SAVED_GAME":"You have an unfinished game","SUDOKU_SAVED_INFO":"%s · time %s · %s cells left","SUDOKU_HINT":"Hint","SUDOKU_HINT_TIP":"Hint (%s left). A cell opened by a hint gives no points.","SUDOKU_HINT_NONE":"No hints left. Every Sudoku you finish earns 1 hint.","SUDOKU_HINT_NAKED":"Because of its row, column and box, only %s fits in this cell.","SUDOKU_HINT_ROW":"%s fits only in this cell of the row.","SUDOKU_HINT_COL":"%s fits only in this cell of the column.","SUDOKU_HINT_BOX":"%s fits only in this cell of the box.","SUDOKU_HINT_REVEAL":"There was no simple step here, so I opened this cell: %s.","SUDOKU_HINT_EARNED":"💡 +1 hint earned (now %s)","SUDOKU_HINTS_USED":"%s hints used","SUDOKU_PENCIL":"Pencil: note candidates (N)","SUDOKU_AUTO_PENCIL":"Auto pencil: write every possible candidate in empty cells","GAME_MINES":"Minesweeper","GAME_MINES_DESC":"3 levels. Your first click is always safe; flag the mines and clear the field. Finish fast for 3 stars, your score goes to your profile.","MINES_EASY":"Easy","MINES_NORMAL":"Medium","MINES_HARD":"Hard","MINES_EASY_HINT":"9×9 · 10 mines · 3★ in 1 min","MINES_NORMAL_HINT":"16×16 · 40 mines · 3★ in 4 min","MINES_HARD_HINT":"16×30 · 99 mines · 3★ in 10 min","MINES_WON":"Field cleared! 🎉","MINES_LOST":"You hit a mine 💥","MINES_LEFT":"Mines left","MINES_FLAG_MODE":"Flag mode","MINES_FIRST":"Open a cell: the first click is always safe, the clock starts then.","MINES_HELP":"Left click opens, right click flags. On a phone, long-press or turn on flag mode. Click a number whose flags are complete to open its other neighbours.","MINES_SAVED_INFO":"%s · time %s · %s mines left","MINES_RESULT":"Base %s points · multiplier ×%s","GAME_INVALID":"Game not found or already finished.","GAME_RESULT_INVALID":"The game result couldn't be verified.","UM_TAB_GAMES":"Games","GAMES_TOTAL_SCORE":"total game score","GAMES_POINTS":"%s pts","GAMES_COL_MODE":"Mode","GAMES_COL_PLAYED":"Played","GAMES_COL_RATE":"Completion","GAMES_COL_BEST":"Best","GAMES_COL_TIME":"Fastest","GAMES_NONE_YET":"Hasn't played a ranked game yet.","GAMES_COL_WINRATE":"Win rate","GAME_VS_BOTS":"Against bots","GAMES_COUNT":"%s games","GAMES_NONE_YET_SELF":"No games played yet. Start one from the 🎮 button in a voice room.","GAMES_TITLE":"Games","GAMES_SUB":"Play a hand on stage while you keep talking.","GAMES_NOTE":"Multiplayer games are experimental. Whoever opens the table starts it; people in the room take the empty seats and bots fill the rest.","GAME_YEDILI":"Pis Yedili","GAME_YEDILI_DESC":"2–4 players. First to empty their hand wins; 7 makes the next player draw, 8 skips, Jack picks the suit. Bots fill empty seats.","GAME_PISTI":"Pişti","GAME_PISTI_DESC":"One on one, with someone in the room or a bot. Take the pile with a matching card or a Jack, score a pişti, collect points.","GAME_DRAW":"Draw a card","GAME_YOUR_HAND":"Your hand","GAME_PASS":"Pass","GAME_RULES":"Rules","GAME_NEW":"New game","GAME_YOU":"You","GAME_BOTS":"Vox Bot,Robo Remzi","GAME_YOUR_TURN":"Your turn.","GAME_PLAYING":"%s is thinking…","GAME_MUST_DRAW":"%s-card penalty: play a 7 or click the deck to take it.","GAME_DREW":"You drew a card. Play one if you can, otherwise pass.","GAME_NO_MOVE":"%s passed.","GAME_LAST_CARD":"%s: Last card!","GAME_WIN":"You won! 🎉","GAME_LOSE":"%s won. Rematch?","GAME_TIE":"It's a tie!","GAME_CHOOSE_SUIT":"You played a Jack, pick the suit.","GAME_SUIT_NOW":"Current suit","GAME_PENALTY":"Penalty: +%s","GAME_DECK_LEFT":"%s cards in the deck","GAME_TABLE_CARDS":"%s cards on the table","GAME_PISTI_BANG":"Pişti! +%s","GAME_CAPTURED":"%s took the pile.","GAME_PISTI_SCORE":"You: %s pts · Bot: %s pts","GAME_TALLY":"Wins — you %s, bots %s","GAME_SKIPPED":"%s skipped","GAME_REVERSED":"direction reversed","GAME_YEDILI_RULES":"Play a card of the same suit or the same rank as the top card.|A Jack can go on any card; you pick the new suit.|7: the next player draws 3. If they have a 7 they can play it to pass the penalty on, growing it by 3.|8: the next player is skipped.|10: play direction reverses.|If you can't play, draw one card; if you still can't, pass.|First to empty their hand wins.","GAME_PISTI_RULES":"Play a card with the same rank as the top card to take the pile.|A Jack also takes the pile.|Taking a single-card pile with the same rank is a pişti: 10 points. A Jack on a Jack is 20.|Each Ace and Jack is 1 point, ♣2 is 2, ♦10 is 3.|Whoever takes the most cards gets 3 more points.|When the deck runs out, cards left on the table go to the last player who took the pile. Most points wins.","GAME_ONLINE":"With friends","GAME_OKEY":"Okey","GAME_OKEY101":"101 Okey","GTB_WAITING":"Waiting %s/%s","GTB_PLAYING":"Playing","GTB_JOIN":"Join","GTB_JOIN_TIP":"Join the room and take a seat","GTB_TIP":"%s table · host: %s","GAME_OKEY_DESC":"Classic 4-player okey. Build your sets, discard the last tile to finish. People in the room take seats; bots fill the rest.","GAME_OKEY_RULES":"106 tiles: 4 colours (yellow, blue, black, red) × 1–13, two of each, plus 2 false jokers.|The tile turned face up is the indicator. The joker (okey) is the same colour, one higher (1 comes after 13). The okey stands in for any tile; a false joker (★) counts as the okey's own value.|The starting player has 15 tiles, everyone else 14. On your turn draw from the middle or take the tile the previous player discarded, then discard one.|Sets: at least 3 consecutive tiles of one colour (12-13-1 is fine, 13-1-2 is not) or 3–4 tiles of the same number in different colours.|When your 14 tiles split into sets or 7 pairs, finish by discarding the last tile.|Finishing with pairs doubles the score, finishing by discarding the okey doubles it again. If the middle runs out, the hand is a draw.","GT_NEW_TAG":"New","GT_BOT":"Bot","GT_AWAY":"(bot playing)","GT_TURN_OF":"Turn: %s","GT_DREW_CARD":"%s drew a card","GT_WON_BY":"%s won!","GT_DEALT":"New cards dealt","GT_TIMEOUT":"(time ran out, auto)","GT_SEAT_EMPTY":"Empty seat","GT_SIT":"Sit","GT_STAND":"Stand up","GT_HOST":"Table opened by %s","GT_WAIT_HOST":"The game starts when %s starts it.","GT_START_HINT":"Start when you're ready; bots take the empty seats.","GT_OPENED":"%s opened a %s table.","GT_JOIN":"Go to table","GT_CLOSED":"The table was closed.","GT_LIVE":"There's a %s table in the room (%s/%s players).","GT_SPECTATING":"You're watching.","GT_SEATS":"Seats","GT_CLOSE":"Close table","GT_START":"Start","GT_LEAVE":"Leave table","GT_NEW_HAND":"New hand","GT_ERR_NOT_IN_ROOM":"You need to be in the voice room to sit at the table.","GT_ERR_BUSY":"There's already a table in this room.","GT_ERR_NOT_HOST":"Only the player who opened the table can do that.","GT_ERR_SEAT_TAKEN":"That seat is taken.","GT_ERR_NOT_YOUR_TURN":"It's not your turn.","GT_ERR_ILLEGAL":"You can't play that card now.","GT_ERR_DEFAULT":"That move couldn't be made.","OK_ERR_NOT_FINISHED":"Not finished: the other 14 tiles must split into sets or 7 pairs.","OK_ERR_MUST_DRAW":"Draw a tile first.","OK_ERR_MUST_DISCARD":"Discard a tile first.","OK_ERR_EMPTY":"There's no tile there.","OK_DRAW_HINT":"Your turn: draw from the middle or take the tile on your left.","OK_DISCARD_HINT":"Pick a tile and discard it, or finish. You can also drag a tile to the spot at the bottom right.","OK_DREW_DECK":"%s drew from the middle","OK_TOOK":"%s took:","OK_FINISHED":"%s finished!","OK_FINISHED_PAIRS":"with pairs","OK_FINISHED_OKEY":"by discarding the okey","OK_TIE":"The middle ran out; the hand is a draw.","OK_TILES":"%s tiles","OK_DRAW_DECK":"Draw from the middle","OK_INDICATOR":"Indicator","OK_FINISH_DROP":"Drop a tile here to finish","OK_TAKE":"Take the discard","OK_DISCARD":"Discard","OK_RACK":"Your rack","OK_SORT_RUNS":"Sort runs","OK_SORT_PAIRS":"Sort pairs","OK_FINISH":"Finish","GAME_OKEY101_DESC":"101 okey for 4 players, solo or in teams. Open with 101 points of sets or 5 pairs, lay off your tiles, first to empty their rack wins. Bots fill empty seats.","GAME_OKEY101_RULES":"106 tiles: 4 colours × 1–13, two of each, plus 2 false jokers. The okey is the same colour, one higher than the indicator, and stands in for any tile.|The starting player gets 22 tiles, everyone else 21; the starter discards on the first turn without drawing. On your turn draw from the middle or take the tile the previous player discarded, optionally open, lay sets or lay off tiles, then discard one.|Sets: at least 3 consecutive tiles of one colour (1 only at the start: neither 12-13-1 nor 13-1-2) or 3–4 tiles of the same number in different colours. A pair is two identical tiles.|To open, your sets must total at least 101 or you need at least 5 pairs. To open, arrange your sets on the rack with an empty slot between them and press OPEN RUNS (OPEN PAIRS for pairs); staged sets are opened when you discard and can be taken back with TAKE BACK until then. Once open you may lay new sets and add tiles to any set on the table. Players who opened with pairs may only lay new pairs, but can still add tiles to runs and sets on the table. Players who opened with sets may also lay pairs later.|The indicator on the table can be laid as a pair with any tile from your hand when you open or lay sets. If a pair on the table holds the indicator and you have the same tile as its partner, put yours in its place and take the indicator; in your hand it still pairs with any tile.|A tile taken from the side must be used that turn (when opening, laying or adding); otherwise put it back and draw from the middle.|Discarding your last tile finishes the hand; if the middle runs out, the lowest penalty wins. Penalty points, lower is better: finisher −101, not opened 202, opened players score their remaining tiles (an okey left in hand counts 100). Pair openers score double; finishing by discarding the okey doubles everyone's penalty. Opening with 7 pairs or with 150+ in melds takes 100 off your penalty.|Once opened, you can take an okey from any meld on the table by putting the real tile it stands for in its place (Take okey).|Discarding the okey or a tile that could be added to a meld on the table (a playable tile) costs 101 (except the final, finishing discard). Pressing OPEN RUNS or OPEN PAIRS restarts your timer at 30 seconds and turns it orange so everyone sees you are opening; discarding without opening costs 101.|In penalty mode, if you use a tile taken from the side, its discarder gets 10× its value (20× if you opened with pairs).|In raising mode you must open with more than the highest opening of the hand so far, or with one pair more than the most pairs opened.|In team play, players sitting opposite are a team; when one finishes, their partner scores 0 for the hand and the team total decides the result.|In a multi-hand match penalties add up; the lowest total wins the match.","O1_DRAW_HINT":"Your turn: draw from the middle or take the tile the previous player discarded.","O1_PLAY_HINT":"Arrange your sets on the rack with an empty slot between them and press OPEN RUNS or OPEN PAIRS; you open when you discard. Otherwise just discard a tile.","O1_PLAY_OPENED_HINT":"OPEN RUNS for new sets, OPEN PAIRS for pairs; to lay off, drag a tile onto a set or press LAY OFF ALL; then discard a tile.","O1_PLAY_PAIRS_HINT":"OPEN PAIRS for new pairs; to lay off, drag a tile onto a set or press LAY OFF ALL; then discard a tile.","O1_TAKEN_HINT":"You must use the tile you took from the side this turn, when opening or adding to a set; otherwise press Put back.","O1_RETURN":"Put back","O1_SIDE_LO":"Low end (%s)","O1_SIDE_HI":"High end (%s)","O1_NOT_OPENED":"not opened","O1_DECK_END":"The middle ran out; nobody finished the hand.","O1_DECK_WIN":"%s wins with the lowest penalty","O1_PLAYER":"Player","O1_HAND":"Left in hand","O1_EV_RETURN":"%s put back the tile taken from the side","O1_EV_OPEN":"%s opened with %s","O1_EV_OPEN_PAIRS":"%s opened with %s pairs","O1_EV_MELD":"%s laid a set (+%s)","O1_EV_ADD":"%s added a tile:","O1_ERR_ALREADY_DREW":"You already drew this turn (the starter discards without drawing).","O1_ERR_EMPTY":"There is no tile to draw.","O1_ERR_NO_TILE":"That tile is not in your hand.","O1_ERR_ILLEGAL":"That move is against the rules right now.","O1_ERR_KEEP_ONE":"Keep at least one tile: you finish by discarding your last tile.","O1_ERR_ADD_LIMIT":"You can add at most %s tiles per turn (taking the okey does not count).","O1_ERR_BAD_MOVE":"Invalid move. Make sure no tile is in two groups.","O1_ERR_MUST_USE_TAKEN":"Use the tile you took from the side before discarding, or press Put back.","O1_ERR_NOT_OPENED":"You need to open before laying sets or adding tiles.","O1_ERR_ALREADY_OPENED":"You have already opened; you can open only once per hand.","O1_ERR_OPEN_TOO_LOW":"You need at least %s to open; your sets total %s.","O1_ERR_OPEN_TOO_LOW_PAIRS":"You need at least %s pairs to open with pairs; you have %s.","O1_ERR_BAD_MELD":"Group %s is not a valid set.","O1_ERR_BAD_PAIR":"Group %s is not a valid pair.","O1_ERR_BAD_ADD":"That tile cannot be added to that set.","O1_ERR_PAIRS_ONLY":"You opened with pairs: you can only lay new pairs.","O1_ERR_OVER":"The hand is over.","O1_OPT_HANDS":"Hands","O1_OPT_PENALTY_INFO":"If the next player takes your discard from the side and uses it, you get 10× its value as a penalty (20× if they opened with pairs).","O1_MATCH_HAND":"Hand %s / %s","O1_TOTALS":"Total","O1_SWAP":"Take okey","O1_ADD":"Add","O1_EV_SWAP":"%s took back the okey, replacing it with","O1_EV_START":"Hand %s started","O1_NEXT_IN":"Hand %s starts in %s seconds","O1_NEXT":"Next hand","O1_NEXT_WAIT":"The host can start it right away.","O1_NEW_MATCH":"New match","O1_MATCH_WON":"You won the match!","O1_MATCH_WINNER":"%s won the match","O1_MATCH_TIE":"The match ended in a tie","O1_HISTORY":"Hand history","O1_DISC_PEN":"Discard penalty","O1_SOLO":"Solo","O1_TEAMS":"Teams","O1_RAISE":"Raising","O1_PEN_MODE":"Penalty","O1_HANDS_CHIP":"Hand %s/%s","O1_OPT_TYPE":"Game type","O1_RAISE_DESC":"Opening with sets needs more than the highest opening so far; opening with pairs needs one pair more than the most pairs opened.","O1_SERI_AC":"Open runs","O1_CIFT_AC":"Open pairs","O1_GERI_TOPLA":"Take back","O1_ISLE_ALL":"Lay off all","O1_SEC":"%s s","O1_PAIRS_N":"%s pairs","O1_STAGE_NONE":"No valid run or set on your rack. Arrange your sets with an empty slot between them.","O1_STAGE_NONE_PAIRS":"No separated pairs on your rack. Leave a gap on both sides of each pair or press SORT PAIRS.","O1_STAGE_LOW":"You need at least %s to open; your staged sets total %s. Add more or TAKE BACK.","O1_STAGE_LOW_PAIRS":"You need at least %s pairs to open; you staged %s. Add more or TAKE BACK.","O1_STAGE_HINT":"Your staged sets (%s / %s) are opened when you discard; TAKE BACK to undo.","O1_STAGE_HINT_OPENED":"Your staged sets are laid when you discard; TAKE BACK to undo.","O1_ISLE_NONE":"None of your tiles fit the sets on the table.","O1_START_T":"Hand %s starting","O1_START_SUB":"Dealing tiles · %s plays first","O1_READY":"Ready","O1_MENU":"Menu","O1_LOBBY_T":"101 Okey · Table","O1_LOBBY_NOTE":"The table always has 4 seats; bots take empty seats.","O1_LOBBY_HOST":"Host: %s","O1_LOBBY_HOST_ME":"Host: you","O1_SEATS":"Seats","O1_TABLE":"Table","O1_PARTNER":"Your partner","O1_HOST_SUB":"Host","O1_EMPTY_SEAT":"Empty · a bot sits","O1_TEAMS_DESC":"In team play, players sitting opposite are a team:","O1_SOLO_DESC":"In solo play everyone plays for themselves. In team play, players sitting opposite are a team.","O1_BLUE":"Blue team","O1_ORANGE":"Orange team","O1_START_GAME":"Start game","O1_HAND_OVER":"Hand %s over","O1_HOW_OKEY":"%s finished with the okey · penalties doubled","O1_HOW_NORMAL":"%s finished","O1_THIS_HAND":"This hand","O1_TOTAL_SHORT":"Tot.","O1_PEN_NOTE":"Discard penalties: %s","O1_HAND_COL":"Hand","O1_PEEK":"View table","O1_CLOSE":"Close","O1_RESULTS":"Results","O1_MATCH_LOST":"You lost the match","O1_WON_TEAM":"Your team won!","O1_LOST_TEAM":"Your team lost","O1_OVER_SUB":"Lowest total penalty after %s hands: %s","O1_OVER_SUB1":"Lowest penalty: %s","O1_COLORS":"yellow,blue,black,red","O1_FAKE":"false joker","O1_TOAST_OKEY":"%s discarded the okey","O1_TOAST_ISLEK":"%s discarded a playable tile (%s)","O1_TOAST_TAKEN":"Penalty mode: %s used the %s taken from the side; penalty to the discarder, %s","O1_TOAST_PTS":"+%s penalty","O1_TOAST_OPEN_FAIL":"%s discarded without opening","O1_TOAST_OKEY_TAKEN":"%s took the okey %s left in a meld","O1_YOU":"You","O1_MY_COLOR":"Your color: melds you laid and tiles you added are marked with it","O1_DECLARED_HINT":"You announced an opening: discarding without opening costs 101 penalty points.","O1_OPENING":"%s is trying to open","O1_OKEY_LEFT":"%s kept the okey in hand","O1_OPENED_FX":"%s opened","O1_ERR_BAD_OPTIONS":"Invalid match option.","O1_ERR_BAD_HANDS":"Hands must be one of: %s","O1_ERR_NO_OKEY":"There is no okey in that meld.","O1_ERR_NO_FIT":"That tile can't replace the okey in that meld.","O1_ERR_NO_TABLE":"No hand is in play; wait for the next hand.","VIEW_AS_READ_ONLY":"You are viewing as this user; this screen is read-only.","VIEW_AS_SELF":"You can't view as yourself.","VIEW_AS_BANNER":"Viewing as %s","VIEW_AS_BANNER_HINT":"Read-only · you can't send messages or join voice","VIEW_AS_EXIT":"Exit","GHOST_OWNER_CANNOT":"The channel owner can't join as a ghost.","CS_INVITES_ACTIVE":"Active Invites","CS_INVITES_LEAD":"Links that can be used to join the channel. Expired invites and invites that reached their member limit are not listed.","CS_INVITES_MINE_ONLY":"Only mine","CS_INVITES_REVOKE_ALL":"Revoke all","CS_INVITES_EMPTY":"No active invites.","CS_INV_CHANNEL_WIDE":"Whole channel","CS_INV_EXPIRES_IN":"Expires in %s","CS_INV_USES":"%1$s / %2$s uses","CS_INV_REVOKE":"Revoke invite","CS_INV_REVOKE_CONFIRM":"Revoke invite %s? Nobody will be able to join with this link anymore.","CS_INV_REVOKE_ALL_CONFIRM":"Revoke all of the channel's active invites? Nobody will be able to join with these links anymore.","CS_INV_REVOKE_MINE_CONFIRM":"Revoke all active invites you created?","CS_JOINED_VIA_INVITE":"Joined via invite: %1$s (invited by %2$s)","CS_JOINED_VIA_INVITE_SHORT":"Joined via invite: %s","UM_JOINED_VIA_INVITE":"Joined via invite: %1$s (invited by %2$s)","VXD_INV_MINE":"My active invites","VXD_INV_REVOKE_MINE_ALL":"Revoke all my invites","INVITE_REVOKED":"This invite has been revoked.","INVITE_REVOKED_TEXT":"This invite was revoked by a channel admin or the person who created it. You can ask the inviter for a new link.","INVITE_REVOKED_OK":"Invite revoked.","INVITES_REVOKED_ALL_OK":"%s invites revoked.","INVITES_NONE_ACTIVE":"There are no active invites to revoke.","AUDIT_INVITE_REVOKED":"%s revoked invite %s (created by %s).","AUDIT_INVITES_REVOKED_ALL":"%s revoked invites in bulk: %s invites.","CS_AFK":"AFK","CS_AFK_ROOM":"AFK Channel","CS_AFK_ROOM_DESC":"Members who stay silent for the set time are moved to this voice room and can't speak there. With \"None\" they are removed from voice.","CS_AFK_NONE":"None","CS_AFK_TIMEOUT":"AFK Timeout","CS_AFK_TIMEOUT_DESC":"Time without any voice activity in a voice room. After it, an \"Are you there?\" warning appears and there is a 60-second grace period.","CS_AFK_1M":"1 minute","CS_AFK_5M":"5 minutes","CS_AFK_10M":"10 minutes","CS_AFK_15M":"15 minutes","CS_AFK_30M":"30 minutes","CS_AFK_1H":"1 hour","AFK_WARNING_TEXT_MOVE":"No voice activity for a while. You will be moved to %2$s in %1$s seconds unless you respond.","AFK_MOVED_NOTICE":"You were moved to the AFK channel (%s) due to inactivity.","AUDIT_AFK_UPDATED":"%s changed AFK settings: channel %s, timeout %s min.","RR_MENU":"Set Up Reaction Roles","RR_TAB":"Reaction Roles","RR_TAB_LEAD":"Members get a role by reacting to a message with a set emoji. To set one up, right-click a channel message and choose \"Set Up Reaction Roles\".","RR_DIALOG_TITLE":"Reaction Roles","RR_MODE":"Mode","RR_MODE_NORMAL":"Normal: react to get the role, remove to lose it","RR_MODE_UNIQUE":"Unique: members can pick only one role from this message","RR_MODE_ADD_ONLY":"Add only: removing the reaction keeps the role","RR_MODE_NORMAL_S":"Normal","RR_MODE_UNIQUE_S":"Unique","RR_MODE_ADD_ONLY_S":"Add only","RR_REQUIRE_RULES":"Only members who accepted the rules","RR_REQUIRE_RULES_OFF":"Rules acceptance is off in this channel.","RR_PAIRS":"Pairs","RR_ADD_ROW":"Add pair","RR_PICK_EMOJI":"Pick emoji","RR_PICK_ROLE":"Pick role","RR_SEED":"Add the emojis to the message","RR_SEED_HINT":"Members without Add Reactions can still join an existing reaction and get the role.","RR_REMOVE":"Remove","RR_REMOVE_ROW":"Remove pair","RR_SAVED":"Reaction roles saved.","RR_DELETED":"Reaction roles removed.","RR_DELETE_CONFIRM":"Remove this message's reaction roles? Roles already given stay.","RR_EMPTY":"No reaction roles yet. Right-click a message and choose \"Set Up Reaction Roles\".","RR_JUMP":"Jump to message","RR_PAUSED":"Paused","RR_PAUSED_HINT":"This role is above the last editor's permissions; it is not being given.","RR_MISSING":"Deleted","RR_LAST_EDIT":"Last saved by %s","RR_NO_TEXT":"(message without text)","RR_ERR_LIMIT":"A message can have at most 20 reaction roles.","RR_ERR_CHANNEL_LIMIT":"A channel can have at most 50 reaction role messages.","RR_ERR_DUP_EMOJI":"The same emoji can't be used twice.","RR_ERR_DUP_ROLE":"The same role can't be used twice.","RR_ERR_ADMIN_ROLE":"Roles with Administrator can't be given by reaction.","RR_ERR_ROLE_RANK":"This role is equal to or above your highest role.","RR_ERR_EMOJI":"This emoji can't be used here.","RR_ERR_MESSAGE":"Reaction roles can't be added to this message.","RR_ERR_INCOMPLETE":"Pick an emoji and a role for every pair.","RR_NOT_READY":"Reaction roles are not available right now.","RR_GOT":"You got the \"%s\" role.","RR_LOST":"The \"%s\" role was removed.","RR_UNAVAILABLE":"This reaction's role can't be given right now.","AUDIT_RR_ASSIGNED":"%s got the %s role by reaction","AUDIT_RR_REMOVED":"%s removed a reaction and lost the %s role","AUDIT_RR_UPDATED":"%s changed reaction roles in %s"}]</JSON>
